#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/client-intro.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upgrade Clients"
msgstr "ອັບເກຣດ Clients"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/client-intro.adoc:2
msgid "Clients use the versioning system of their underlying operating system.  For clients using {suse} operating systems, you can perform upgrades within the {productname} {webui}."
msgstr "ໄຄລແອນຈະໃຊ້ລະບົບເວີຊັນຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການທີ່ໃຊ້ຢູ່. ສຳລັບໄຄລແອນທີ່ໃຊ້ລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ {suse}, ທ່ານສາມາດເຮັດການອັບເກຣດໄດ້ພາຍໃນ {productname} {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/client-intro.adoc:3
msgid "For more information about upgrading clients, see xref:client-configuration:client-upgrades.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການອັບເກຣດໄຄລແອນ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:client-configuration:client-upgrades.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Connect {payg} instance"
msgstr "ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ {payg} ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:2
msgid "In the major public cloud providers (AWS, Azure), SUSE:"
msgstr "ໃນຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຄລາວສາທາລະນະຫຼັກ (AWS, Azure), SUSE:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:3
msgid "provides customized {payg} product images for SLES, SLES for SAP, etc."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ບໍລິການອິມເມຈຜະລິດຕະພັນ {payg} ທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງມາສະເພາະສຳລັບ SLES, SLES for SAP ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:4
msgid "operates per-region RMT Servers mirroring repositories for products available as {payg}"
msgstr "ດຳເນີນການ RMT Servers ແຍກຕາມພາກພື້ນ ເພື່ອທຳການ mirror ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ (repositories) ສຳລັບຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ແບບ {payg}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:5
msgid "This document describes how to connect existing {payg} instance to {productname} server, and gives basic information about credentials collection from the instance.  The goal of this connection is to extract authentication data so the {productname} Server can connect to a cloud RMT host.  Then the {productname} Server has access to products on the RMT host that are not already available with the {scc} organization credentials."
msgstr "ເອກະສານນີ້ອະທິບາຍວິທີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ {payg} ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວເຂົ້າກັບ {productname} ເຊີເວີ, ແລະ ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນພື້ນຖານກ່ຽວກັບການເກັບລວບລວມຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ (credentials) ຈາກອິນສະແຕນຊ໌. ເປົ້າໝາຍຂອງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ນີ້ແມ່ນເພື່ອດຶງຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ {productname} ເຊີເວີ ສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ cloud RMT host ໄດ້. ຈາກນັ້ນ {productname} ເຊີເວີ ຈະສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງຜະລິດຕະພັນໃນ RMT host ທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງອົງກອນ {scc}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:6
msgid "Before using {payg} feature make sure that:"
msgstr "ກ່ອນຈະໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດ {payg} ໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:7
msgid "The {payg} instance is launched from the correct SUSE product image (for example, SLES, SLES for SAP, or SLE HPC) to allow access to the desired repositories"
msgstr "{payg} ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານຈາກອິມເມຈຜະລິດຕະພັນ SUSE ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ (ຕົວຢ່າງ: SLES, SLES for SAP, ຫຼື SLE HPC) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຕ້ອງການໄດ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:8
msgid "{productname} Server has connectivity to the {payg} instance (ideally in the same region) either directly or via a bastion"
msgstr "{productname} ເຊີເວີ ມີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ {payg} ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (ໂດຍປົກກະຕິຄວນຢູ່ໃນພາກພື້ນດຽວກັນ) ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນໂດຍກົງ ຫຼື ຜ່ານ bastion"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:9
msgid "A basic {scc} account is required. Enter your valid {scc} credentials in menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Organization Credentials]. This account is required for accessing the {productname} client tools for boostrapping regardless of {payg} instances."
msgstr "ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີບັນຊີ {scc} ພື້ນຖານ. ປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວ {scc} ທີ່ໃຊ້ໄດ້ຂອງທ່ານໃນ menu:Admin[Setup Wizard > Organization Credentials]. ບັນຊີນີ້ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງເຄື່ອງມືໄຄລແອນຂອງ {productname} ເພື່ອເຮັດ bootstrap ໂດຍບໍ່ຄຳນຶງເຖິງ {payg} ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:10
msgid "If you bootstrap the {payg} instance to {productname}, it will disable its {payg} repositories then add repositories from where it mirrored the data from the RMT server. The final result will be {payg} instances acquiring the same repositories from the RMT servers but through the {productname} server itself. Of course repositories can still be setup primarily from SCC."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານເຮັດ bootstrap {payg} instance ໄປທີ່ {productname}, ມັນຈະປິດການໃຊ້ງານ {payg} repositories ເດີມ ແລ້ວເພີ່ມ repositories ທີ່ Mirror ຂໍ້ມູນມາຈາກ RMT server ແທນ. ຜົນໄດ້ຮັບສຸດທ້າຍຄື {payg} instances ຈະໄດ້ຮັບ repositories ດຽວກັນຈາກ RMT servers ແຕ່ຜ່ານທາງ {productname} server ເອງ. ແນ່ນອນວ່າ repositories ຍັງສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າຫຼັກຈາກ SCC ໄດ້ຄືເກົ່າ."

