msgid "Available products are all versions of the same product family and architecture as the one installed in the {payg} instance.  For example, if the instance has the {sles}{nbsp}15 SP1 product installed, {sles}{nbsp}15 SP2, {sles}{nbsp}15 SP3, {sles}{nbsp}15 SP4 and {sles}{nbsp}15 SP5 are automatically shown in `Admin > Setup Wizard > Products`."
