#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instance credential collect status"
msgstr "ສະຖານະການເກັບລວບລວມຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:50
msgid "{productname} server uses credentails collected from the instance to connect to the RMT server and to download the packages using reposync.  These credentials are refreshed every 10 minutes by taskomatic using the defined SSH connection data. Connection to RMT server always uses the last known authentication credentials collected from the {payg} instance."
msgstr "{productname} ເຊີເວີ ໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວທີ່ເກັບມາຈາກອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ ເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ RMT server ແລະ ເພື່ອດາວໂຫຼດແພັກເກດໂດຍໃຊ້ reposync. ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກຣີເຟຣຊ (refreshed) ທຸກໆ 10 ນາທີ ໂດຍ taskomatic ໂດຍໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້. ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ RMT server ຈະໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຫຼ້າສຸດທີ່ເກັບມາຈາກ {payg} ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ ສະເໝີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:51
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "The status of the {payg} instance credentials collect is shown in the column [literal]``Status`` or on the instance details page.  When the instance is not reachable, the credential update process will fail."
msgid "The status of the {payg} instance credentials collect is shown in the column `Status` or on the instance details page.  When the instance is not reachable, the credential update process will fail."
msgstr "ສະຖານະຂອງການເກັບລວບລວມຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງ {payg} ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ ຈະສະແດງໃນຖັນ [literal]``Status`` ຫຼື ໃນໜ້າລາຍລະອຽດຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌. ເມື່ອບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ໄດ້, ຂະບວນການອັບເດດຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:52
msgid "When the instance is unreachable, the credential update process will fail and the credentials will become invalid after the second failed refresh.  Synchronization of channels will fail when the credentials are invalid.  To avoid this keep the connected instances running."
msgstr "ເມື່ອອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້, ຂະບວນການອັບເດດຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຈະກາຍເປັນໃຊ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ ຫຼັງຈາກການຣີເຟຣຊຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວຄັ້ງທີສອງ. ການ Synchronization ຂອງຊ່ອງທາງຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວເມື່ອຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວໃຊ້ບໍ່ໄດ້. ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນບັນຫານີ້ ໃຫ້ເປີດອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄວ້ໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ສະເໝີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:53
msgid "{payg} instance remains connected to {productname} server unless SSH connection data is explicitly deleted.  To delete the SSH connection data to the instance, use <<proc-deleting-connection-data-to-instance>>."
msgstr "{payg} ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ ຈະຍັງຄົງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ {productname} ເຊີເວີ ຈົນກວ່າຂໍ້ມູນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH ຈະຖືກລຶບອອກໂດຍກົງ. ເພື່ອລຶບຂໍ້ມູນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSH ໄປຫາອິນສະແຕນຊ໌, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ <<proc-deleting-connection-data-to-instance>>."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:54
msgid "{payg} instance may not be accessible from the {productname} server at all times."
msgstr "{payg} ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ ອາດຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຈາກ {productname} ເຊີເວີ ຕະຫຼອດເວລາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:55
msgid "If the instance exists, but is stopped, the last known credentials will be used to try to connect to the instance."
msgstr "ຫາກອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ມີຢູ່ ແຕ່ຖືກຢຸດໄວ້ (stopped), ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຫຼ້າສຸດທີ່ຮູ້ຈັກຈະຖືກນຳມາໃຊ້ເພື່ອພະຍາຍາມເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບອິນສະແຕນຊ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:56
msgid "How long the credentials remain valid depends on the cloud provider."
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຈະຍັງໃຊ້ໄດ້ນັ້ນ ຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຄລາວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:57
msgid "If the instance no longer exists, but is still registered with SUMA, its credentials are no longer valid and the authentication will fail."
msgstr "ຫາກອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ບໍ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ ແຕ່ຍັງຄົງລົງທະບຽນກັບ SUMA ຢູ່, ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງມັນຈະບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ອີກຕໍ່ໄປ ແລະ ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:58
msgid "The error message is shown in the column Status."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມຜິດພາດຈະສະແດງຢູ່ໃນຖັນ Status."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:59
msgid "The error message only indicates that the instance is not available.  Further diagnostics about the status of the instance needs to be done on the cloud provider."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມຜິດພາດພຽງແຕ່ບອກວ່າອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ບໍ່ພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານ. ການກວດສອບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບສະຖານະຂອງອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ ຕ້ອງເຮັດໃນລະບົບຂອງຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຄລາວ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:60
msgid "Any of the following actions or changes in the {payg} instance will lead to credentials failing:"
msgstr "ການກະທຳ ຫຼື ການປ່ຽນແປງໃດໆ ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃນ {payg} ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:61
msgid "removing zypper credentials files"
msgstr "ການລຶບໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງ zypper"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:62
msgid "removing the imported certificates"
msgstr "ການລຶບໃບຮັບຮອງ (certificates) ທີ່ນຳເຂົ້າໄວ້"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:63
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "removing cloud-specific entries from [path]``/etc/hosts``"
msgid "removing cloud-specific entries from `/etc/hosts`"
msgstr "ການລຶບລາຍການທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຄລາວອອກຈາກ [path]``/etc/hosts``"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "Registering {payg} system as a client"
msgstr "ການລົງທະບຽນລະບົບ {payg} ເປັນໄຄລແອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:65
msgid "You can register a {payg} instance from where you harvest the credentials as a {salt} client.  The instance needs to have a valid cloud connection registered, otherwise it will not have access to channels.  If the user removes the cloud packages, the credentials harvesting may stop working."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດລົງທະບຽນ {payg} ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (ບ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານເກັບຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວມາ) ເປັນໄຄລແອນ {salt} ໄດ້. ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີການລົງທະບຽນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຄລາວທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງຊ່ອງທາງຕ່າງໆ ໄດ້. ຫາກຜູ້ໃຊ້ລຶບແພັກເກດຄລາວອອກ, ການເກັບຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວອາດຈະຢຸດເຮັດວຽກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:66
msgid "First set up the {payg} instance to collect authentication data, so it can synchronize the channels."
msgstr "ກ່ອນອື່ນ ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ {payg} ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ ເພື່ອເກັບລວບລວມຂໍ້ມູນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມັນສາມາດ synchronize ຊ່ອງທາງຕ່າງໆ ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
