#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/connect-payg.adoc:68
msgid "For more about registering clients, see xref:client-configuration:registration-overview.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການລົງທະບຽນໄຄລແອນ, ເບິ່ງທີ່ xref:client-configuration:registration-overview.adoc[]."

