msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} Proxy Virtual Machine, ເບິ່ງ xref:container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-vm-mlm.adoc[Deploy Proxy as a Virtual Machine]."

