#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:15
msgid "Some formulas, like Bind and DHCP (Kea), also use containers.  If you plan to use them in an air-gapped environment, you need to pull their images, save them to an archive, and load them on your {productname} Proxy or another managed system."
msgstr "Formulas ບາງຢ່າງ ເຊັ່ນ Bind ແລະ DHCP (Kea) ກໍໃຊ້ຄອນເທນເນີນຳອີກ. ຫາກທ່ານວາງແຜນຈະໃຊ້ພວກມັນໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມແບບ air-gapped, ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງ pull images ຂອງພວກມັນ, ບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນ archive, ແລ້ວໂຫຼດພວກມັນລົງໃນ {productname} Proxy ຫຼື ລະບົບອື່ນໆ ທີ່ຈັດການຢູ່."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:23
msgid "The images are available from `registry.suse.com`."
msgstr "ຮູບພາບ (images) ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຈາກ `registry.suse.com`."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Getting formula images for air-gapped environments"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຮັບ formula images ສຳລັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມແບບ air-gapped"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:25
msgid "On a system with Internet access, pull the required images."
msgstr "ໃນລະບົບທີ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງອິນເຕີເນັດໄດ້, ໃຫ້ pull images ທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"podman pull registry.suse.com/suse/bind:latest\n"
"podman pull registry.suse.com/suse/kea:2.6\n"
msgstr ""
"podman pull registry.suse.com/suse/bind:latest\n"
"podman pull registry.suse.com/suse/kea:2.6\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:27
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:20
msgid "Save the images to a TAR archive:"
msgstr "ບັນທຶກຮູບພາບລົງໃນ TAR archive:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "podman save -m -o formula-images.tar registry.suse.com/suse/bind:latest registry.suse.com/suse/kea:2.6\n"
msgstr "podman save -m -o formula-images.tar registry.suse.com/suse/bind:latest registry.suse.com/suse/kea:2.6\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:29
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:22
msgid "Transfer the `formula-images.tar` file to your air-gapped system."
msgstr "ໂອນຍ້າຍໄຟລ໌ `formula-images.tar` ໄປຍັງລະບົບ air-gapped ຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:30
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:23
msgid "Load the images on the air-gapped system:"
msgstr "ໂຫຼດຮູບພາບລົງໃນລະບົບ air-gapped:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc:31
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-air-gapped-deployment-uyuni.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "podman load -i formula-images.tar\n"
msgstr "podman load -i formula-images.tar\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Convert a Client to MLM Proxy"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນ Client ໃຫ້ເປັນ MLM Proxy"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:2
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:2
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "ພາບລວມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:3
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:3
msgid "This chapter describes how to convert a client system into a {productname} Proxy using the {webui}."
msgstr "ບົດນີ້ອະທິບາຍວິທີການປ່ຽນລະບົບ client ໃຫ້ເປັນ {productname} Proxy ໂດຍໃຊ້ {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:4
msgid "It assumes that the proxy host system has already been bootstrapped, is subscribed to the base operating system channel (such as {sles} 15 SP7 or {sl-micro} 6.2) and to the Proxy Extension channel."
msgstr "ມັນສົມມຸດວ່າລະບົບ proxy host ໄດ້ຮັບການ bootstrap ແລ້ວ, ໄດ້ subscribe ໃນ base operating system channel (ເຊັ່ນ {sles} 15 SP7 ຫຼື {sl-micro} 6.2) ແລະ ໃນ Proxy Extension channel ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:5
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:5
msgid "For information about client onboarding, see xref:client-configuration:registration-overview.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃຊ້ງານ client (onboarding), ເບິ່ງ xref:client-configuration:registration-overview.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:7
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:7
msgid "Before starting the conversion, ensure the following requirements are fulfilled."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມການປ່ຽນລະບົບ, ກວດເບິ່ງໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂໍ້ກຳນົດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຄົບຖ້ວນແລ້ວ."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Supported Systems"
msgstr "ລະບົບທີ່ຮອງຮັບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:9
msgid "Only the following operating systems are currently supported for proxy conversion:"
msgstr "ປັດຈຸບັນຮອງຮັບພຽງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນສຳລັບການປ່ຽນເປັນພຣັອກຊີ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:11
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "{sl-micro} 6.1"
msgid "{sl-micro} 6.2"
msgstr "{sl-micro} 6.1"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:12
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client Must Be"
msgstr "Client ຕ້ອງ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:13
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:9
msgid "Already onboarded in {productname}"
msgstr "ໄດ້ຖືກ onboarded ໃນ {productname} ແລ້ວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:14
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:10
msgid "Reachable via the network"
msgstr "ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຜ່ານເຄືອຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:15
msgid "Subscribed to the appropriate proxy extension channel:"
msgstr "ໄດ້ subscribe ໃນ proxy extension channel ທີ່ເໝາະສົມ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:16
msgid "{productname} Proxy Extension 5.2 (matching architecture)"
msgstr "{productname} Proxy Extension 5.2 (ທີ່ກົງກັບສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ)"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:17
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Preparation"
msgstr "ການກຽມພ້ອມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:18
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:12
msgid "Before proceeding with the proxy conversion, make sure the following preparations are completed to avoid interruptions during the conversion process."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະດຳເນີນການປ່ຽນພຣັອກຊີ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄດ້ກຽມຄວາມພ້ອມຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຮຽບຮ້ອຍແລ້ວ ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການຢຸດຊະງັກໃນລະຫວ່າງຂັ້ນຕອນ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:19
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:13
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "SSL Certificates"
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:20
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:14
msgid "Valid SSL certificates are required to secure communication between the proxy and other components."
msgstr "ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພໃນການສື່ສານລະຫວ່າງພຣັອກຊີ ແລະ ສ່ວນປະກອບອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:21
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:15
msgid "You need:"
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:22
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:16
msgid "The public certificate of the Certificate Authority (CA) that signed the certificate on the {productname} server"
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນສາທາລະນະ (public certificate) ຂອງ Certificate Authority (CA) ທີ່ເຊັນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໃນ {productname} server"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:23
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:17
msgid "A certificate for the proxy."
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນສຳລັບພຣັອກຊີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:24
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:18
msgid "The corresponding private key for the proxy certificate."
msgstr "Private key ທີ່ກົງກັບໃບຢັ້ງຢືນພຣັອກຊີ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:25
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:19
msgid "If your CA uses an intermediate certificate chain, you must include all intermediate certificates as well."
msgstr "ຫາກ CA ຂອງທ່ານໃຊ້ intermediate certificate chain, ທ່ານຕ້ອງລວມເອົາ intermediate certificates ທັງໝົດເຂົ້າໄປນຳ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:26
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:20
msgid "If you are not using third party certificates, you can generate them using the `rhn-ssl-tool` inside the {productname} container."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຈາກພາກສ່ວນທີສາມ, ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງພວກມັນໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ `rhn-ssl-tool` ພາຍໃນ {productname} container."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:27
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generate a proxy certificate"
msgstr "ສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນພຣັອກຊີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:28
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:22
msgid "On the {productname} server host, run:"
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} server host, ໃຫ້ລັນ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:29
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- rhn-ssl-tool --gen-server \\\n"
"  --set-hostname=\"<PROXY-FQDN>\" \\\n"
"  --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\"\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- rhn-ssl-tool --gen-server \\\n"
"  --set-hostname=\"<PROXY-FQDN>\" \\\n"
"  --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:30
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:24
msgid "For more information about other parameters, see xref:administration:ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບພາຣາມີເຕີອື່ນໆ, ເບິ່ງ xref:administration:ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:31
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:25
msgid "Transfer the certificates to {productname} server host"
msgstr "ໂອນຍ້າຍໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໄປຫາ {productname} server host"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:32
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl cp server:/root/ssl-build/<PROXY-FQDN>/server.crt /root/proxycert.pem\n"
"mgrctl cp server:/root/ssl-build/<PROXY-FQDN>/server.key /root/proxykey.pem\n"
"mgrctl cp server:/root/ssl-build/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT /root/rootca.pem\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl cp server:/root/ssl-build/<PROXY-FQDN>/server.crt /root/proxycert.pem\n"
"mgrctl cp server:/root/ssl-build/<PROXY-FQDN>/server.key /root/proxykey.pem\n"
"mgrctl cp server:/root/ssl-build/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT /root/rootca.pem\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:33
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:27
msgid "To confirm the exact folder where the certificates and key files were generated, you can list the directories with:"
msgstr "ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນໂຟນເດີທີ່ແນ່ນອນບ່ອນທີ່ໄຟລ໌ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ ແລະ ຄີຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ, ທ່ານສາມາດສະແດງລາຍຊື່ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີດ້ວຍ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:34
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-conversion-from-client-uyuni.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -ti -- ls -ltd /root/ssl-build/*/\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- ls -ltd /root/ssl-build/*/\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-conversion-from-client-mlm.adoc:35
msgid "Transfer the certificates from the {productname} server host to your local machine or other target system:"
