#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc:19
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:8
