#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:19
msgid "You can leverage the simplicity of storage by mounting an external storage device to this directory.  Because it will store the {postgresql} database, binary packages for repositories, caches, operating system images, autoinstallation distributions, and configuration files, we have three recommendations:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ປະໂຫຍດຈາກຄວາມງ່າຍຂອງການເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໂດຍການ Mount ອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນພາຍນອກເຂົ້າໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້. ເນື່ອງຈາກວ່າມັນຈະເກັບຖານຂໍ້ມູນ {postgresql}, ແພັກເກດ Binary ສຳລັບ repositories, caches, images ຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການ, autoinstallation distributions, ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ, ພວກເຮົາຈຶ່ງມີສາມຄຳແນະນຳ:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fast Storage"
msgstr "ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຄວາມໄວສູງ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:21
msgid "This mount point should ideally be NVMe or SSD-class devices.  Slower storage will adversely affect {productname} performance."
msgstr "ຈຸດ Mount ນີ້ຄວນຈະເປັນອຸປະກອນປະເພດ NVMe ຫຼື SSD. ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຊ້າກວ່າຈະສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບທາງລົບຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບຂອງ {productname}."

#. type: Labeled list
