msgid "You can provide custom storage for the volumes by mounting disks on the expected volume path inside it such as `/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk`.  This adds to the complexity of a {productname} deployment, and may affect the resilience the default storage recommendation provides."
