#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc:30
msgid "You can deploy {productname} on {sl-micro} {microversion} or {sles} {bci-mlm}.  {sl-micro} is a transactional system, while {sles} is a full server operating system."
