#, no-wrap
msgid "{productname} {productnumber} Server Deployment as a Virtual Machine - KVM"
msgstr "ການນຳໃຊ້ {productname} {productnumber} Server ໃນຮູບແບບ Virtual Machine - KVM"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vm-mlm.adoc:2
msgid "This chapter provides the required Virtual Machine settings for deployment of {productname} {productnumber} as an image.  KVM will be combined with Virtual Machine Manager (_virt-manager_) as a sandbox for this installation."
msgstr "ບົດນີ້ໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Virtual Machine ທີ່ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການນຳໃຊ້ {productname} {productnumber} ໃນຮູບແບບ Image. KVM ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ Virtual Machine Manager (_virt-manager_) ເປັນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງນີ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vm-mlm.adoc:4
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vmdk-mlm.adoc:4
msgid "The preferred method for deploying {productname} {productnumber} Server is to use one of the following available images.  All tools are included in these images greatly simplifying deployment."
msgstr "ວິທີທີ່ແນະນຳໃນການນຳໃຊ້ {productname} {productnumber} Server ແມ່ນການໃຊ້ Image ໃດໜຶ່ງທີ່ມີຢູ່ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້. ເຄື່ອງມືທັງໝົດໄດ້ຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນ Image ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແລ້ວ ເຮັດໃຫ້ການນຳໃຊ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ."

#. type: Plain text
