#, fuzzy
#| msgid "If Podman wasn’t installed automatically, install it with [command]``zypper in podman`` and rerun the restore/start steps."
msgid "If Podman wasn’t installed automatically, install it with `zypper in podman` and rerun the restore/start steps."
msgstr "ຫາກ Podman ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ໃຫ້ຕິດຕັ້ງດ້ວຍ [command]``zypper in podman`` ແລະ ລັນຂັ້ນຕອນການ restore/start ອີກຄັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:63
msgid "Ensure the target host has the same time, hostname, and IP configuration expected by your setup (especially if clients exist)."
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ host ປາຍທາງມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າເວລາ, hostname, ແລະ IP ຕົງກັບທີ່ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງການ (ໂດຍສະເພາະຫາກມີລູກຂ່າຍຢູ່ແລ້ວ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:64
msgid "For large environments, ensure adequate disk throughput and space. The backup and restore can take a long time."
msgstr "ສຳລັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່, ຕ້ອງຮັບປະກັນວ່າມີຄວາມໄວໃນການຮັບສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນດິດ ແລະ ພື້ນທີ່ພຽງພໍ. ການ backup ແລະ restore ອາດໃຊ້ເວລາດົນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/migrate-uyuni-server-from-micro55-tumbleweed.adoc:65
msgid "If the restore fails or the new system cannot start, you can still boot the original openSUSE Leap Micro 5.5 system and continue service. Keep the original VM/snapshots until you fully validate the new Tumbleweed-based server."
msgstr "ຫາກການກູ້ຄືນລົ້ມເຫຼວ ຫຼື ລະບົບໃໝ່ບໍ່ສາມາດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄດ້, ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດບູດລະບົບ openSUSE Leap Micro 5.5 ເດີມ ແລະ ດຳເນີນການບໍລິການຕໍ່ໄດ້. ໃຫ້ຮັກສາ VM/snapshots ເດີມໄວ້ຈົນກວ່າທ່ານຈະກວດສອບເຊີເວີທີ່ເປັນ Tumbleweed ໃໝ່ໄດ້ຢ່າງສົມບູນ."

