#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:7
msgid "For general requirements, see xref:installation-and-upgrade:general-requirements.adoc[General requirements]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການທົ່ວໄປ, ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:general-requirements.adoc[ຄວາມຕ້ອງການທົ່ວໄປ]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:20
msgid "An {opensuse} {tumbleweed} server should be installed from installation media.  This procedure is described below."
msgstr "ຄວນຕິດຕັ້ງ {opensuse} {tumbleweed} ເຊີເວີຈາກສື່ການຕິດຕັ້ງ (installation media). ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ຖືກອະທິບາຍໄວ້ລຸ່ມນີ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:21
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Container Host Requirements"
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງ Container Host"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:22
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:12
msgid "For CPU, RAM, and storage requirements, see xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc[Hardware requirements]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການດ້ານ CPU, RAM, ແລະ ພື້ນທີ່ຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ, ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc[ຄວາມຕ້ອງການດ້ານຮາດແວ]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:23
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/server-deployment-uyuni.adoc:13
msgid "To guarantee that clients can resolve the FQDN domain name, both the containerized server and the host machines must be linked to a functional DNS server. Additionally, it is essential to ensure correct configuration of reverse lookups."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າລູກຂ່າຍສາມາດຊອກຫາຊື່ໂດເມນ FQDN ໄດ້, ທັງເຊີເວີໃນຮູບແບບຄອນເທນເນີ ແລະ ເຄື່ອງໂຮສ ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເຊີເວີ DNS ທີ່ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້. ນອກຈາກນີ້, ມັນຍັງສຳຄັນທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງຮັບປະກັນວ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າການຄົ້ນຫາແບບຍ້ອນກັບນັ້ນຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc:25
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-register-proxy-mlm.adoc:14
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "This step is optional.  However, if custom persistent storage is required for your infrastructure, use the [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` tool."
msgid "This step is optional.  However, if custom persistent storage is required for your infrastructure, use the `mgr-storage-proxy` tool."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ເປັນທາງເລືອກ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ຫາກໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງການການຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບຄົງທີ່ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື [command]``mgr-storage-proxy``."

