#, fuzzy
#| msgid "The scripts take disk devices as arguments.  [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` requires a single argument for the storage disk device.  [command]``mgr-storage-server`` requires a storage disk device and can optionally accept a second argument for a dedicated database disk device.  While both normal and database storage can reside on the same disk, it is advisable to place the database on a dedicated, high-performance disk to ensure better performance and easier management."
