#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:17
msgid "Both tools automate standard Linux storage operations.  There is no hidden or custom logic beyond what a Linux administrator would do manually."
msgstr "ທັງສອງເຄື່ອງມືນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍເຮັດໃຫ້ການຈັດການບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນມາດຕະຖານຂອງ Linux ເປັນແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ບໍ່ມີເຫດຜົນທີ່ເຊື່ອງໄວ້ ຫຼື ແບບພິເສດນອກເໜືອໄປຈາກສິ່ງທີ່ຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ Linux ຈະເຮັດດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "What these tools do *not* do"
msgstr "ສິ່ງທີ່ເຄື່ອງມືເຫຼົ່ານີ້ *ບໍ່ໄດ້* ເຮັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:19
msgid "They do *not* create or manage LVM volumes."
msgstr "ພວກມັນ *ບໍ່ໄດ້* ສ້າງ ຫຼື ຈັດການວໍລຸມ LVM."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:20
msgid "They do *not* configure RAID or complex storage topologies."
msgstr "ພວກມັນ *ບໍ່ໄດ້* ຕັ້ງຄ່າ RAID ຫຼື ໂຄງສ້າງການເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຊັບຊ້ອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:21
msgid "They do *not* prevent you from managing storage using normal Linux tools after setup."
msgstr "ພວກມັນ *ບໍ່ໄດ້* ຂັດຂວາງເຈົ້າຈາກການຈັດການບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງມື Linux ທົ່ວໄປຫຼັງຈາກຕັ້ງຄ່າແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:22
msgid "They do *not* provide dynamic resizing or expansion capabilities — these must be handled using standard Linux storage tools."
msgstr "ພວກມັນ *ບໍ່ໄດ້* ໃຫ້ຄວາມສາມາດໃນການປັບຂະໜາດ ຫຼື ຂະຫຍາຍແບບໄດນາມິກ — ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຕ້ອງຖືກຈັດການດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງມືບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນມາດຕະຖານຂອງ Linux."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Post-installation storage management"
msgstr "ການຈັດການບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຫຼັງການຕິດຕັ້ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:24
msgid "Once storage has been configured, you can safely manage it using standard Linux commands."
msgstr "ເມື່ອບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າແລ້ວ, ເຈົ້າສາມາດຈັດການມັນໄດ້ຢ່າງປອດໄພໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງມາດຕະຖານຂອງ Linux."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example 1: Extending storage if using LVM"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ 1: ການຂະຫຍາຍບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຖ້າໃຊ້ LVM"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"lvextend -L +10G /dev/your_vg/your_lv\n"
"xfs_growfs /var/lib/containers/storage/volumes\n"
msgstr ""
"lvextend -L +10G /dev/your_vg/your_lv\n"
"xfs_growfs /var/lib/containers/storage/volumes\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example 2: Migrating to a larger disk "
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງ 2: ການຍ້າຍຂໍ້ມູນໄປຍັງດິສກ໌ທີ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ "

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:29
msgid "Add and format the new disk."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມ ແລະ ຟໍແມັດດິສກ໌ໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:30
msgid "Mount it temporarily."
msgstr "ເມົາທ໌ມັນໄວ້ຊົ່ວຄາວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:31
msgid "Use `rsync` to copy data."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ `rsync` ເພື່ອກ່າຍຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:32
msgid "Update `/etc/fstab`."
msgstr "ອັບເດດ `/etc/fstab`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:33
msgid "Remount at the correct location."
msgstr "ເມົາທ໌ຄືນໃໝ່ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "When to use, or not use"
msgstr "ຄວນໃຊ້ ຫຼື ບໍ່ຄວນໃຊ້ເມື່ອໃດ"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:35
msgid "Always take a backup before making changes to your storage setup."
msgstr "ສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນສະເໝີກ່ອນທີ່ຈະປ່ຽນແປງການຕັ້ງຄ່າບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:36
msgid "Use these tools *only* during initial storage setup or when migrating to new storage where the tool is expected to handle data migration and update `/etc/fstab`."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືເຫຼົ່ານີ້ *ສະເພາະ* ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ຫຼື ເມື່ອຍ້າຍໄປຍັງບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໃໝ່ ເຊິ່ງເຄື່ອງມືຈະຊ່ວຍຈັດການການຍ້າຍຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ອັບເດດ `/etc/fstab` ໃຫ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:37
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Do *not* rerun these scripts for resizing or expanding storage. Use standard Linux tools (e.g., [literal]``lvextend``, [literal]``xfs_growfs``) for such operations."
msgid "Do *not* rerun these scripts for resizing or expanding storage. Use standard Linux tools (e.g., `lvextend`, `xfs_growfs`) for such operations."
msgstr "*ຫ້າມ* ລັນສະຄຣິບເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຊ້ຳເພື່ອການປັບຂະໜາດ ຫຼື ຂະຫຍາຍບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືມາດຕະຖານຂອງ Linux (ເຊັ່ນ: [literal]``lvextend``, [literal]``xfs_growfs``) ສຳລັບການເຮັດວຽກດັ່ງກ່າວ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "ບົດສະຫຼຸບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:39
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "[command]``mgr-storage-server`` and [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` help automate the initial persistent storage setup for {productname} components using standard Linux storage practices.  They do not limit or interfere with standard storage management afterward."
msgid "`mgr-storage-server` and `mgr-storage-proxy` help automate the initial persistent storage setup for {productname} components using standard Linux storage practices.  They do not limit or interfere with standard storage management afterward."
msgstr "[command]``mgr-storage-server`` ແລະ [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` ຊ່ວຍເຮັດໃຫ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຖາວອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບອົງປະກອບຂອງ {productname} ເປັນແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍໃຊ້ວິທີການຈັດການບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນມາດຕະຖານຂອງ Linux. ພວກມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຈຳກັດ ຫຼື ແຊກແຊງການຈັດການບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນມາດຕະຖານໃນພາຍຫຼັງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:40
msgid "After setup, continue managing your storage using familiar Linux tools."
msgstr "ຫຼັງຈາກຕັ້ງຄ່າແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ຈັດການບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຂອງທ່ານຕໍ່ໄປໂດຍໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມື Linux ທີ່ທ່ານຄຸ້ນເຄີຍ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/container-management/storage-scripts.adoc:41
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "A full database volume can cause significant issues with system operation.  As disk usage notifications have not yet been adapted for containerized environments, users are encouraged to monitor the disk space used by Podman volumes themselves, either through tools such as Grafana, Prometheus, or any other preferred method.  Pay particular attention to the var-pgsql volume, located under [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/``."
msgid "A full database volume can cause significant issues with system operation.  As disk usage notifications have not yet been adapted for containerized environments, users are encouraged to monitor the disk space used by Podman volumes themselves, either through tools such as Grafana, Prometheus, or any other preferred method.  Pay particular attention to the var-pgsql volume, located under `/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/`."
msgstr "ຖານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ເຕັມອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາຮ້າຍແຮງຕໍ່ການເຮັດວຽກຂອງລະບົບ. ເນື່ອງຈາກການແຈ້ງເຕືອນການໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ດິດຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ຖືກປັບໃຫ້ເຂົ້າກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມແບບ container, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈຶ່ງຖືກແນະນຳໃຫ້ຕິດຕາມພື້ນທີ່ດິດທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍ Podman volumes ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະຜ່ານເຄື່ອງມືເຊັ່ນ Grafana, Prometheus, ຫຼື ວິທີອື່ນໆທີ່ຕ້ອງການ. ໃຫ້ເອົາໃຈໃສ່ເປັນພິເສດຕໍ່ var-pgsql volume ທີ່ຢູ່ໃນ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/``."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:1
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-install-requirements.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "General Requirements"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ກຳນົດທົ່ວໄປ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:2
msgid "Before you begin installation, ensure that you have:"
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເລີ່ມການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ໃຫ້ໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:3
msgid "A {scclongform} account.  This account gives you access to organization credentials and registration keys for {productname} Server, Proxy and Retail Branch Server."
msgstr "ບັນຊີ {scclongform}. ບັນຊີນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງອົງກອນ ແລະ ຄີການລົງທະບຽນສຳລັບ {productname} Server, Proxy ແລະ Retail Branch Server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:4
msgid "Supported Browsers for {productname} {webui}."
msgstr "ບຣາວເຊີທີ່ຮອງຮັບສຳລັບ {productname} {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:5
msgid "SSL certificates for your environment.  By default {productname} {productnumber} uses a self-signed certificate."
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL ສຳລັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານ. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ {productname} {productnumber} ຈະໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນແບບ self-signed."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:6
msgid "The {sl-micro} {microversion} entitlement is included within the {productname} entitlement, so it does not require a separate registration key."
msgstr "ສິດການນຳໃຊ້ (entitlement) ຂອງ {sl-micro} {microversion} ແມ່ນລວມຢູ່ໃນສິດຂອງ {productname} ແລ້ວ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ຕ້ອງການກຸນແຈລົງທະບຽນແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:7
msgid "The following section contains more information on these requirements."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ປະກອບມີຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "{scclongform} Account and Credentials"
msgstr "ບັນຊີ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງ {scclongform}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:9
msgid "Create an account with {scclongform} prior to deployment of {productname} {productnumber}."
msgstr "ສ້າງບັນຊີກັບ {scclongform} ກ່ອນການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} {productnumber}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Obtain Your Organization Credentials"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ວິທີຮັບຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວຂອງອົງກອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:11
msgid "Navigate to https://scc.suse.com/login in your web browser."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ https://scc.suse.com/login ໃນບຣາວເຊີຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:12
msgid "Log in to your {scc} account, or follow the prompts to create a new account."
msgstr "ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບດ້ວຍບັນຊີ {scc} ຂອງທ່ານ, ຫຼື ເຮັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນເພື່ອສ້າງບັນຊີໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:13
msgid "If you have not yet done so, click btn:[Connect to an Organization] and type or search for your organization."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ເຮັດ, ໃຫ້ຄລິກ btn:[Connect to an Organization] ແລະ ພິມ ຫຼື ຄົ້ນຫາອົງກອນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/general-requirements.adoc:14
