#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:12
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "By default the {productname} Server container stores mirrored repository (packages or products), database, and other data in subdirectories of the [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/`` directory.  Repository synchronization fails if this directory runs out of disk space.  Estimate how much space the [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/`` directory requires based on the number and kind of clients and repositories you plan to mirror."
msgid "By default the {productname} Server container stores mirrored repository (packages or products), database, and other data in subdirectories of the `/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/` directory.  Repository synchronization fails if this directory runs out of disk space.  Estimate how much space the `/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/` directory requires based on the number and kind of clients and repositories you plan to mirror."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຄອນເທນເນີ {productname} Server ຈະເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ repository ທີ່ເຮັດ mirror ໄວ້, ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນອື່ນໆໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຍ່ອຍຂອງ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/``. ການຊິງໂຄຣໄນຊ໌ repository ຈະຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວຖ້າພື້ນທີ່ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນີ້ເຕັມ. ໃຫ້ປະເມີນພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ໂດຍອີງຕາມຈຳນວນ ແລະ ປະເພດຂອງຄລາຍເອນ ລວມທັງ repository ທີ່ທ່ານວາງແຜນຈະເຮັດ mirror."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:13
msgid "For more information about filesystem and partitioning details, see xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc#install-hardware-requirements-storage[] and the detailed installation instructions in the Installation and Deployment sections of this guide."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບລະບົບໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ການແບ່ງພາກສ່ວນ (partition), ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc#install-hardware-requirements-storage[] ແລະ ຄຳແນະນຳການຕິດຕັ້ງລະອຽດໃນພາກສ່ວນການຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ການນຳໃຊ້ຂອງຄູ່ມືນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:14
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "The images by default have a 40 GB [literal]``/`` partition.  The cloud image of {sl-micro} {microversion} has just a 5 GB [literal]``/`` partition.  Both work flawlessly with {productname}.  As long as external storage is mounted to [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes``, {productname} does not need or use storage on the [literal]``/`` partition, but leaves that to the management of the container host itself."
msgid "The images by default have a 40 GB `/` partition.  The cloud image of {sl-micro} {microversion} has just a 5 GB `/` partition.  Both work flawlessly with {productname}.  As long as external storage is mounted to `/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes`, {productname} does not need or use storage on the `/` partition, but leaves that to the management of the container host itself."
msgstr "ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ ຮູບພາບຕ່າງໆຈະມີ partition [literal]``/`` ຂະໜາດ 40 GB. ສ່ວນ cloud image ຂອງ {sl-micro} {microversion} ຈະມີພຽງ 5 GB. ທັງສອງແບບສາມາດເຮັດວຽກກັບ {productname} ໄດ້ຢ່າງດີ. ຕາບໃດທີ່ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນພາຍນອກຖືກ mount ໄປຫາ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes``, {productname} ກໍ່ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ໃນ partition [literal]``/`` ແລະ ປ່ອຍໃຫ້ເປັນການຈັດການຂອງຕົວເຄື່ອງ host ເອງ."

