msgid "The `/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/uyuni-proxy-squid-cache/` directory can be small on the {productname} Server compared to the proxy.  For a guide to size estimation, see the <<server-hardware-requirements>> section."
msgstr "ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/uyuni-proxy-squid-cache/`` ໃນ {productname} Server ສາມາດມີຂະໜາດນ້ອຍກວ່າໃນພຣັອກຊີໄດ້. ສຳລັບວິທີການປະເມີນຂະໜາດ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງໃນພາກສ່ວນ <<server-hardware-requirements>>."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:28
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "In general, {suse} recommends to adjust the value for the cache directory to about 80 % of available free space.  The [option]``cache_dir`` value is set when generating proxy configuration on the server.  You cannot set the option directly in [path]``squid.conf``."
msgid "In general, {suse} recommends to adjust the value for the cache directory to about 80 % of available free space.  The `cache_dir` value is set when generating proxy configuration on the server.  You cannot set the option directly in `squid.conf`."
msgstr "ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ {suse} ແນະນຳໃຫ້ປັບຄ່າຂອງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີແຄັດໃຫ້ຢູ່ທີ່ປະມານ 80% ຂອງພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງທີ່ມີຢູ່. ຄ່າ [option]``cache_dir`` ຈະຖືກກຳນົດເມື່ອມີການສ້າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າພຣັອກຊີໃນເຊີເວີ. ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດກຳນົດຕົວເລືອກນີ້ໂດຍກົງໃນ [path]``squid.conf`` ໄດ້."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Swap space"
msgstr "Swap space"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:30
msgid "Workloads differ from system to system.  Systems with heavy or unpredictable workloads can benefit from additional swap space, regardless of total RAM.  It is recommended to place swap on the fastest available storage (for example, SSD).  {suse} recommends using a swap file instead of a swap partition."
msgstr "ພາລະງານ (Workloads) ແມ່ນແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປໃນແຕ່ລະລະບົບ. ລະບົບທີ່ມີພາລະງານໜັກ ຫຼື ຄາດເດົາບໍ່ໄດ້ອາດຈະໄດ້ຮັບປະໂຫຍດຈາກ swap space ເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ບໍ່ວ່າຈະມີ RAM ທັງໝົດເທົ່າໃດກໍ່ຕາມ. ຂໍແນະນຳໃຫ້ວາງ swap ໄວ້ໃນບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ໄວທີ່ສຸດ (ເຊັ່ນ SSD). {suse} ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ swap file ແທນ swap partition."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:31
msgid "For size recommendations, see the tables above."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳກ່ຽວກັບຂະໜາດ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງຕາຕະລາງຂ້າງເທິງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:32
msgid "The following shell command snippet creates a 8GiB swap file."
msgstr "ຊຸດຄຳສັ່ງ shell ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະສ້າງ swap file ຂະໜາດ 8GiB."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:33
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "A swap file on BtrFS filesystem prevent creating of a snapshot of that volume.  [path]``/var`` in the following example is already excluded from the snapper snapshots, so it is safe to use [path]``/var/swap``."
msgid "A swap file on BtrFS filesystem prevent creating of a snapshot of that volume.  `/var` in the following example is already excluded from the snapper snapshots, so it is safe to use `/var/swap`."
msgstr "Swap file ເທິງລະບົບໄຟລ໌ BtrFS ຈະປ້ອງກັນການສ້າງ snapshot ຂອງ volume ນັ້ນ. [path]``/var`` ໃນຕົວຢ່າງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໄດ້ຖືກຍົກເວັ້ນຈາກ snapper snapshots ແລ້ວ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈຶ່ງປອດໄພທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ [path]``/var/swap``."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"## setup swapfile at /var/swap\n"
"# run following as a root user\n"
msgstr ""
"## ຕັ້ງຄ່າ swapfile ທີ່ /var/swap\n"
"# ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໃນຖານະ root\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# allocate 8GiB for swap file\n"
"fallocate -l 8G /var/swap\n"
"# ensure CoW is disabled for the swap file\n"
"chattr +C /var/swap\n"
"# allow only root access\n"
"chmod 600 /var/swap\n"
"# make swap file based on allocated file\n"
"mkswap /var/swap\n"
"# activate swap use for the running system\n"
"swapon /var/swap\n"
"# activate swap during the next boots\n"
"echo \"/var/swap swap swap defaults 0 0\" >> /etc/fstab\n"
msgstr ""
"# ຈອງພື້ນທີ່ 8GiB ສຳລັບ swap file\n"
"fallocate -l 8G /var/swap\n"
"# ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ CoW ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານສຳລັບ swap file\n"
"chattr +C /var/swap\n"
"# ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ສະເພາະ root ເຂົ້າເຖິງ\n"
"chmod 600 /var/swap\n"
"# ສ້າງ swap file ຈາກໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈອງໄວ້\n"
"mkswap /var/swap\n"
"# ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ swap ສຳລັບລະບົບທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກ\n"
"swapon /var/swap\n"
"# ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ swap ໃນເວລາ boot ຄັ້ງຕໍ່ໄປ\n"
"echo \"/var/swap swap swap defaults 0 0\" >> /etc/fstab\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "Database Requirement"
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:37
msgid "{postgresql} is the only supported database.  Using a remote {postgresql} database or remote file systems (such as NFS) with the {postgresql} database is not supported.  In other words, {postgresql} should be on the fastest available storage device for {productname}."
msgstr "{postgresql} ແມ່ນຖານຂໍ້ມູນດຽວທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນ. ການໃຊ້ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ {postgresql} ແບບຣີໂມດ (remote) ຫຼື ການໃຊ້ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ຣີໂມດ (ເຊັ່ນ NFS) ຮ່ວມກັບຖານຂໍ້ມູນ {postgresql} ແມ່ນບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການສະໜັບສະໜູນ. ເວົ້າອີກຢ່າງໜຶ່ງແມ່ນ {postgresql} ຄວນຕິດຕັ້ງຢູ່ໃນອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ໄວທີ່ສຸດທີ່ມີສຳລັບ {productname}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:38
msgid "Because of potential performance issues, running a {postgresql} database remotely from {productname} is discouraged.  While such an environment is possible and even stable in many cases, there is always a risk of data loss if something goes wrong."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກບັນຫາດ້ານປະສິດທິພາບທີ່ອາດຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນ, ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ລັນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ {postgresql} ແບບຣີໂມດຈາກ {productname}. ເຖິງວ່າສະພາບແວດລ້ອມດັ່ງກ່າວຈະສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ ແລະ ມີຄວາມສະຖຽນໃນຫຼາຍກໍລະນີ, ແຕ່ກໍຍັງມີຄວາມສ່ຽງທີ່ຈະສູນເສຍຂໍ້ມູນຫາກມີສິ່ງຜິດປົກກະຕິເກີດຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:39
msgid "{suse} might not be able to provide assistance in such cases."
msgstr "{suse} ອາດຈະບໍ່ສາມາດໃຫ້ການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອໄດ້ໃນກໍລະນີດັ່ງກ່າວ."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "Persistent Storage and Permissions"
msgstr "ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຖາວອນ ແລະ ການກຳນົດສິດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:41
msgid "Persistent volumes are created by default when deploying the container."
msgstr "ວໍລຸມຖາວອນຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອມີການຕິດຕັ້ງຄອນເທນເນີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:42
msgid "However, it is recommended that the volumes are stored on one or more separate storage devices.  Such a setup helps avoid data loss in production environments.  This can be done after container deployment."
msgstr "ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ຂໍແນະນຳໃຫ້ເກັບວໍລຸມໄວ້ໃນອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແຍກຕ່າງຫາກໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍອັນ. ການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼີກລ່ຽງການສູນເສຍຂໍ້ມູນໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມການເຮັດວຽກຈິງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ຫຼັງຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງຄອນເທນເນີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:43
msgid "Storage devices best should be set up after first deploying the container.  For more details, see xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc[Persistent Container Volumes]."
msgstr "ອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຄວນຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຫຼັງຈາກການຕິດຕັ້ງຄອນເທນເນີຄັ້ງທຳອິດ. ສຳລັບລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc[Persistent Container Volumes]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:44
msgid "We recommend you use XFS as the filesystem type for all volumes.  The size of the disk for repositories storage is dependent on the number of distributions and channels you intend to manage with {productname}.  See the tables in this section for guides to estimate the size required."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານໃຊ້ XFS ເປັນປະເພດລະບົບໄຟລ໌ສຳລັບທຸກວໍລຸມ. ຂະໜາດຂອງດິສກ໌ສຳລັບເກັບ repository ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບຈຳນວນຂອງ distribution ແລະ channel ທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຈັດການດ້ວຍ {productname}. ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງຕາຕະລາງໃນພາກສ່ວນນີ້ເພື່ອເປັນແນວທາງໃນການປະເມີນຂະໜາດທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:45
msgid "Do not use NFS for {cobbler} or {postgresql} storage, neither NFS on SELinux environments.  These scenarios are not supported."
msgstr "ຫ້າມໃຊ້ NFS ສຳລັບບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ {cobbler} ຫຼື {postgresql}, ລວມທັງຫ້າມໃຊ້ NFS ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ SELinux. ສະຖານະການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ແມ່ນບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:46
msgid "On the {productname} Server, use this command to find all available storage devices:"
msgstr "ໃນ {productname} Server, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອຄົ້ນຫາອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດທີ່ມີ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:47
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "hwinfo --disk | grep -E \"Device File:\"\n"
msgstr "hwinfo --disk | grep -E \"Device File:\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:48
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Use the [command]``lsblk`` command to see the name and size of each device."
msgid "Use the `lsblk` command to see the name and size of each device."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``lsblk`` ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຊື່ ແລະ ຂະໜາດຂອງແຕ່ລະອຸປະກອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:49
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Use the [command]``mgr-storage-server`` command with the device names to set up the external disks as the locations for the storage and, optionally on a disk of its own, for the database:"
msgid "Use the `mgr-storage-server` command with the device names to set up the external disks as the locations for the storage and, optionally on a disk of its own, for the database:"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgr-storage-server`` ພ້ອມກັບຊື່ອຸປະກອນເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າດິສກ໌ພາຍນອກໃຫ້ເປັນບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ຖ້າຕ້ອງການ ສາມາດແຍກດິສກ໌ອີກອັນໜຶ່ງສຳລັບຖານຂໍ້ມູນ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:53
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "The external storage volumes are set up as XFS partitions mounted at [path]``/manager_storage`` and [path]``/pgsql_storage``."
msgid "The external storage volumes are set up as XFS partitions mounted at `/manager_storage` and `/pgsql_storage`."
msgstr "volumes ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນພາຍນອກຈະຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນ XFS partitions ທີ່ mount ໄວ້ທີ່ [path]``/manager_storage`` ແລະ [path]``/pgsql_storage``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:56
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "It is possible to use the same storage device for both channel data and the database.  This is not recommended, as growing channel repositories might fill up the storage, which poses a risk to database integrity.  Using separate storage devices may also increase performance.  If you want to use a single storage device, run [command]``mgr-storage-server`` with a single device name parameter."
msgid "It is possible to use the same storage device for both channel data and the database.  This is not recommended, as growing channel repositories might fill up the storage, which poses a risk to database integrity.  Using separate storage devices may also increase performance.  If you want to use a single storage device, run `mgr-storage-server` with a single device name parameter."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນດຽວກັນສຳລັບທັງຂໍ້ມູນ channel ແລະ ຖານຂໍ້ມູນໄດ້. ແຕ່ບໍ່ແນະນຳ, ເພາະ repository ຂອງ channel ທີ່ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນເຕັມ, ເຊິ່ງເປັນອັນຕະລາຍຕໍ່ຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນ. ການໃຊ້ອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແຍກກັນຍັງຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບອີກດ້ວຍ. ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ອຸປະກອນດຽວ, ໃຫ້ລັນ [command]``mgr-storage-server`` ໂດຍລະບຸພາຣາມິເຕີຊື່ອຸປະກອນພຽງອັນດຽວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:57
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "If you are installing a proxy, the [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` command takes only one device name parameter and will set up the external storage location as the Squid cache."
msgid "If you are installing a proxy, the `mgr-storage-proxy` command takes only one device name parameter and will set up the external storage location as the Squid cache."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານກຳລັງຕິດຕັ້ງພຣັອກຊີ, ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` ຈະຮັບພາຣາມິເຕີຊື່ອຸປະກອນພຽງອັນດຽວ ແລະ ຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນພາຍນອກໃຫ້ເປັນ Squid cache."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "Logical Volume Management (LVM)"
msgstr "ການຈັດການວໍລຸມແບບໂລຈິກ (LVM)"

#.  container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-vm-mlm.adoc etc.
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:59
msgid "For all kind of virtual machines (VM), LVM is generally not needed and not recommended.  The disk setup is virtual and separate disks for volumes are possible and recommended."
msgstr "ສຳລັບເວີຊວລແມຊີນ (VM) ທຸກປະເພດ, ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວ LVM ແມ່ນບໍ່ຈຳເປັນ ແລະ ບໍ່ແນະນຳ. ເນື່ອງຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າດິສກ໌ເປັນແບບເວີຊວລ, ການແຍກດິສກ໌ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະວໍລຸມຈຶ່ງສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ ແລະ ເປັນສິ່ງທີ່ແນະນຳ."

#.  container-deployment/mlm/server-deployment-mlm.adoc
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:60
msgid "For other deployments, separate disks for volumes are also recommended."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບອື່ນໆ, ກໍແນະນຳໃຫ້ແຍກດິສກ໌ສຳລັບແຕ່ລະວໍລຸມເຊັ່ນກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:61
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "On the container host of the {productname} Server, the [command]``mgr-storage-server`` command moves the complete content of the [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes`` directory to a separate disk and remounts it to [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes``."
msgid "On the container host of the {productname} Server, the `mgr-storage-server` command moves the complete content of the `/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes` directory to a separate disk and remounts it to `/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes`."
msgstr "ໃນ container host ຂອງ {productname} Server, ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgr-storage-server`` ຈະຍ້າຍເນື້ອໃນທັງໝົດຂອງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes`` ໄປຍັງດິດແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ ແລະ mount ມັນຄືນໃໝ່ໄປທີ່ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:62
