#| msgid "Optionally, if a second device name is specified, [command]``mgr-storage-server`` moves the content of the [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-pgsql`` database directory to a second separate disk and remounts it to [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-pgsql``."
