#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/hardware-requirements.adoc:63
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Similarly, on the container host of the {productname} Proxy, the [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` command moves the complete content of the [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes`` directory to a separate disk and remounts it to [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes``."
msgid "Similarly, on the container host of the {productname} Proxy, the `mgr-storage-proxy` command moves the complete content of the `/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes` directory to a separate disk and remounts it to `/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes`."
msgstr "ໃນທຳນອງດຽວກັນ, ໃນຄອນເທນເນີໂຮສ໌ຂອງ {productname} Proxy, ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgr-storage-proxy`` ຈະຍ້າຍເນື້ອຫາທັງໝົດຂອງໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes`` ໄປຍັງດິສກ໌ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ ແລະ ເມົາທ໌ມັນຄືນໃໝ່ທີ່ [path]``/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes``."

