#, no-wrap
msgid "Network Requirements"
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການດ້ານເຄືອຂ່າຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:2
msgid "This section details the networking and port requirements for {productname}."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ໃຫ້ລາຍລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການດ້ານເຄືອຂ່າຍ ແລະ ພອດສຳລັບ {productname}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:3
msgid "IP forwarding will be enabled by containerized installation.  This means {productname} Server and Proxies will behave as a router.  This behavior is done by podman directly.  Podman containers do not run if IP forwarding is disabled."
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບຄອນເທນເນີຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານ IP forwarding. ສິ່ງນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າ {productname} Server ແລະ Proxy ຈະເຮັດວຽກຄືກັບເຣົາເຕີ (router). ພຶດຕິກຳນີ້ແມ່ນຖືກຈັດການໂດຍ podman ໂດຍກົງ. ຄອນເທນເນີຂອງ Podman ຈະບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກຫາກ IP forwarding ຖືກປິດ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:4
msgid "Consider achieving network isolation of the {productname} environment according to your policies."
msgstr "ຄວນພິຈາລະນາການເຮັດ network isolation ສຳລັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ {productname} ຕາມນະໂຍບາຍຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:5
msgid "For more information, see https://www.suse.com/support/kb/doc/?id=000020166."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ https://www.suse.com/support/kb/doc/?id=000020166."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fully Qualified Domain Name (FQDN)"
msgstr "ຊື່ໂດເມນທີ່ລະບຸຕົວຕົນໄດ້ຢ່າງສົມບູນ (FQDN)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:7
msgid "The {productname} server must resolve its FQDN correctly.  If the FQDN cannot be resolved, it can cause serious problems in a number of different components."
msgstr "ເຊີເວີ {productname} ຕ້ອງສາມາດລະບຸ (resolve) FQDN ຂອງມັນໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ. ຫາກ FQDN ບໍ່ສາມາດລະບຸໄດ້, ມັນອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີດບັນຫາຮ້າຍແຮງໃນຫຼາຍອົງປະກອບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:8
msgid "For more information about configuring the hostname and DNS, see {sles-base-os-documentation}/cha-network.html#sec-network-yast-change-host."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ hostname ແລະ DNS, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ {sles-base-os-documentation}/cha-network.html#sec-network-yast-change-host."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hostname and IP Address"
msgstr "Hostname ແລະ ທີ່ຢູ່ IP"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:10
msgid "To ensure that the {productname} domain name can be resolved by its clients, both server and client machines must be connected to a working DNS server.  You also need to ensure that reverse lookups are correctly configured."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຊື່ໂດເມນ {productname} ສາມາດລະບຸໄດ້ໂດຍໄຄເອັນ, ທັງເຄື່ອງເຊີເວີ ແລະ ໄຄເອັນ ຕ້ອງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ DNS server ທີ່ໃຊ້ງານໄດ້. ທ່ານຍັງຕ້ອງໝັ້ນໃຈວ່າ reverse lookups ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:11
msgid "For more information about setting up a DNS server, see {sles-base-os-documentation}/cha-dns.html."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ DNS ເຊີເວີ, ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງ {sles-base-os-documentation}/cha-dns.html."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reenable router advertisements"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ router advertisements ອີກຄັ້ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:13
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "When the {productname} is installed using [command]``mgradm install podman`` or [command]``mgrpxy install podman``, it sets up Podman which enables IPv4 and IPv6 forwarding.  This is needed for communication from the outside of the container."
msgid "When the {productname} is installed using `mgradm install` or `mgrpxy install`, it sets up Podman which enables IPv4 and IPv6 forwarding.  This is needed for communication from the outside of the container."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ໂດຍໃຊ້ [command]``mgradm install podman`` ຫຼື [command]``mgrpxy install podman``, ມັນຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າ Podman ເຊິ່ງຈະເປີດໃຊ້ IPv4 ແລະ IPv6 forwarding. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການສື່ສານຈາກພາຍນອກຄອນເທນເນີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:14
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "However, if your system previously had [literal]``/proc/sys/net/ipv6/conf/eth0/accept_ra`` set to [literal]``1``, it will stop using router advertisements.  As a result, the routes are no longer obtained via router advertisements and the default IPv6 route is missing."
msgid "However, if your system previously had `/proc/sys/net/ipv6/conf/eth0/accept_ra` set to `1`, it will stop using router advertisements.  As a result, the routes are no longer obtained via router advertisements and the default IPv6 route is missing."
msgstr "ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ຖ້າລະບົບຂອງທ່ານເຄີຍຕັ້ງຄ່າ [literal]``/proc/sys/net/ipv6/conf/eth0/accept_ra`` ເປັນ [literal]``1`` ມາກ່ອນ, ມັນຈະຢຸດການໃຊ້ router advertisements. ສົ່ງຜົນໃຫ້ບໍ່ສາມາດຮັບເສັ້ນທາງ (routes) ຜ່ານ router advertisements ໄດ້ອີກ ແລະ ເສັ້ນທາງ IPv6 ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈະຫາຍໄປ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:15
msgid "To recover correct functioning of the IPv6 routing, follow the procedure depending on whether:"
