#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:16
msgid "server and proxy are based on {bci-mlm} (without Network manager)"
msgstr "server ແລະ proxy ໃຊ້ {bci-mlm} (ໂດຍບໍ່ມີ Network manager)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:17
