#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deployment behind HTTP or HTTPS OSI level 7 proxy"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງພາຍໃຕ້ HTTP ຫຼື HTTPS OSI level 7 proxy"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:35
msgid "Some environments enforce internet access through a HTTP or HTTPS proxy.  This could be a Squid server or similar.  To allow the {productname} Server internet access in such configuration, you need to configure the following."
msgstr "ບາງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມມີການບັງຄັບໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງອິນເຕີເນັດຜ່ານ HTTP ຫຼື HTTPS proxy. ນີ້ອາດຈະເປັນ Squid ເຊີເວີ ຫຼື ທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນ. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ {productname} Server ເຂົ້າເຖິງອິນເຕີເນັດໄດ້ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບນີ້, ທ່ານຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າດັ່ງນີ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring HTTP or HTTPS OSI level 7 proxy"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ HTTP ຫຼື HTTPS OSI level 7 proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:37
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "For operating system internet access, modify [path]``/etc/sysconfig/proxy`` according to your needs:"
