msgstr "ພອດເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ຈຳເປັນ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:50
msgid "This section contains a comprehensive list of ports that are used for various communications within {productname}."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ລວມລາຍການພອດທັງໝົດທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສື່ສານຕ່າງໆພາຍໃນ {productname}."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:51
msgid "You will not need to open all of these ports.  Some ports only need to be opened if you are using the service that requires them."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເປີດພອດທັງໝົດເຫຼົ່ານີ້. ບາງພອດຈະຕ້ອງເປີດກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອທ່ານໃຊ້ບໍລິການທີ່ຕ້ອງການພອດນັ້ນໆ."

