#, no-wrap
msgid "External Inbound Server Ports"
msgstr "ພອດຂາເຂົ້າພາຍນອກຂອງເຊີເວີ"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:58
msgid "External inbound ports must be opened to configure a firewall on the {productname} Server to protect the server from unauthorized access."
msgstr "ຕ້ອງເປີດພອດຂາເຂົ້າພາຍນອກເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າໄຟວໍໃນເຊີເວີ {productname} ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນເຊີເວີຈາກການເຂົ້າເຖິງທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດ."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:59
msgid "Opening these ports allows external network traffic to access the {productname} Server."
msgstr "ການເປີດພອດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການຈະລາຈອນເຄືອຂ່າຍພາຍນອກສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງເຊີເວີ {productname} ໄດ້."

