msgid ""
"| Port number | Protocol | Used By    | Notes\n"
"| 67          | TCP/UDP  | DHCP       | Required only if clients are requesting IP addresses from the server.\n"
"| 69          | TCP/UDP  | TFTP       | Required if server is used as a PXE server for automated client installation.\n"
"| 80          | TCP      | HTTP       | Required temporarily for some bootstrap repositories and automated installations.\n"
"| 443         | TCP      | HTTPS      | Serves the {webui}, client, and server and proxy (`tftpsync`) requests.\n"
"| 4505        | TCP      | salt       | Required to accept communication requests from clients.\n"
"The client initiates the connection, and it stays open to receive commands from the Salt master.\n"
"| 4506        | TCP      | salt       | Required to accept communication requests from clients.\n"
"The client initiates the connection, and it stays open to report results back to the Salt master.\n"
"| 5432        | TCP      | PostgreSQL | Required to access the reporting database.\n"
"| 5556        | TCP      | Prometheus | Required for scraping Taskomatic JMX metrics.\n"
"| 5557        | TCP      | Prometheus | Required for scraping Tomcat JMX metrics.\n"
"| 9100        | TCP      | Prometheus | Required for scraping Node exporter metrics.\n"
"| 9187        | TCP      | Prometheus | Required for scraping PostgreSQL metrics.\n"
"| 9800        | TCP      | Prometheus | Required for scraping Taskomatic metrics.\n"
msgstr ""
"| ເລກພອດ | ໂປຣໂຕຄໍ | ໃຊ້ໂດຍ | ໝາຍເຫດ\n"
"| 67 | TCP/UDP | DHCP | ຈຳເປັນກໍ່ຕໍ່ເມື່ອ clients ຂໍທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຈາກເຄື່ອງແມ່ຂ່າຍ.\n"
"| 69 | TCP/UDP | TFTP | ຈຳເປັນຫາກເຄື່ອງແມ່ຂ່າຍຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນ PXE server ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ client ແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"
"| 80 | TCP | HTTP | ຈຳເປັນຊົ່ວຄາວສຳລັບບາງ bootstrap repositories ແລະ ການຕິດຕັ້ງແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"
"| 443 | TCP | HTTPS | ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ {webui}, client, ແລະ ຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍຈາກ server ແລະ proxy (``tftpsync``).\n"
"| 4505 | TCP | salt | ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອຮັບຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍການສື່ສານຈາກ clients. Client ຈະເປັນຜູ້ເລີ່ມການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ແລະ ມັນຈະເປີດຄ້າງໄວ້ເພື່ອຮັບຄຳສັ່ງຈາກ Salt master.\n"
"| 4506 | TCP | salt | ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອຮັບຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍການສື່ສານຈາກ clients. Client ຈະເປັນຜູ້ເລີ່ມການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ແລະ ມັນຈະເປີດຄ້າງໄວ້ເພື່ອລາຍງານຜົນກັບໄປຫາ Salt master.\n"
"| 5432 | TCP | PostgreSQL | ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງຖານຂໍ້ມູນການລາຍງານ.\n"
"| 5556 | TCP | Prometheus | ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ (scraping) Taskomatic JMX metrics.\n"
"| 5557 | TCP | Prometheus | ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ (scraping) Tomcat JMX metrics.\n"
"| 9100 | TCP | Prometheus | ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ (scraping) Node exporter metrics.\n"
"| 9187 | TCP | Prometheus | ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ (scraping) PostgreSQL metrics.\n"
"| 9800 | TCP | Prometheus | ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ (scraping) Taskomatic metrics.\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "External Outbound Server Ports"
msgstr "ພອດຂາອອກພາຍນອກຂອງເຊີເວີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:63
msgid "External outbound ports must be opened to configure a firewall on the {productname} Server to restrict what the server can access."
msgstr "ຕ້ອງເປີດພອດຂາອອກພາຍນອກເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າໄຟວໍໃນເຊີເວີ {productname} ເພື່ອຈຳກັດສິ່ງທີ່ເຊີເວີສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:64
msgid "Opening these ports allows network traffic from the {productname} Server to communicate with external services."
msgstr "ການເປີດພອດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການຈະລາຈອນເຄືອຂ່າຍຈາກເຊີເວີ {productname} ສາມາດສື່ສານກັບບໍລິການພາຍນອກໄດ້."

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:66
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Port number | Protocol | Used By | Notes\n"
"| 80          | TCP | HTTP       | Required for {scclongform}.\n"
"Port 80 is not used to serve the {webui}.\n"
"| 443         | TCP | HTTPS      | Required for {scclongform}.\n"
msgstr ""
"| ເລກພອດ | ໂປຣໂຕຄໍ | ໃຊ້ໂດຍ | ໝາຍເຫດ\n"
"| 80 | TCP | HTTP | ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ {scclongform}. ພອດ 80 ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ບໍລິການ {webui}.\n"
"| 443 | TCP | HTTPS | ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ {scclongform}.\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "Internal Server Ports"
msgstr "ພອດພາຍໃນຂອງເຊີເວີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:68
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Internal ports are used internally by the {productname} Server.  Internal ports are only accessible from [literal]``localhost``."
msgid "Internal ports are used internally by the {productname} Server.  Internal ports are only accessible from `localhost`."
msgstr "ພອດພາຍໃນຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍພາຍໃນເຊີເວີ {productname}. ພອດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ສະເພາະຈາກ [literal]``localhost`` ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:69
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:87
msgid "In most cases, you will not need to adjust these ports."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ທ່ານບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງປັບປ່ຽນພອດເຫຼົ່ານີ້."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:70
#, no-wrap
msgid "Internal Port Requirements for {productname} Server"
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການພອດພາຍໃນສຳລັບ {productname} Server"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:71
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Port number | Notes\n"
"| 2828        | Satellite-search API, used by the RHN application in Tomcat and Taskomatic.\n"
"| 2829        | Taskomatic API, used by the RHN application in Tomcat.\n"
"| 8005        | Tomcat shutdown port.\n"
"| 8009        | Tomcat to Apache HTTPD (AJP).\n"
"| 8080        | Tomcat to Apache HTTPD (HTTP).\n"
"| 9080        | Salt-API, used by the RHN application in Tomcat and Taskomatic.\n"
"| 32000       | Port for a TCP connection to the Java Virtual Machine (JVM) that runs Taskomatic and satellite-search.\n"
msgstr ""
"| ເລກພອດ | ໝາຍເຫດ\n"
"| 2828 | Satellite-search API, ໃຊ້ໂດຍ RHN application ໃນ Tomcat ແລະ Taskomatic.\n"
"| 2829 | Taskomatic API, ໃຊ້ໂດຍ RHN application ໃນ Tomcat.\n"
"| 8005 | ພອດປິດລະບົບ (shutdown) ຂອງ Tomcat.\n"
"| 8009 | Tomcat ຫາ Apache HTTPD (AJP).\n"
"| 8080 | Tomcat ຫາ Apache HTTPD (HTTP).\n"
"| 9080 | Salt-API, ໃຊ້ໂດຍ RHN application ໃນ Tomcat ແລະ Taskomatic.\n"
"| 32000 | ພອດສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ TCP ໄປຫາ Java Virtual Machine (JVM) ທີ່ເປີດໃຊ້ Taskomatic ແລະ satellite-search.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:72
msgid "Port 32768 and higher are used as ephemeral ports.  These are most often used to receive TCP connections.  When a TCP connection request is received, the sender will choose one of these ephemeral port numbers to match the destination port."
msgstr "ພອດ 32768 ຂຶ້ນໄປຖືກໃຊ້ເປັນພອດຊົ່ວຄາວ (ephemeral ports). ພອດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ມັກຈະຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອຮັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ TCP. ເມື່ອມີການຮ້ອງຂໍການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ TCP, ຜູ້ສົ່ງຈະເລືອກເລກພອດຊົ່ວຄາວໜຶ່ງໃນນີ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ກົງກັບພອດປາຍທາງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:73
msgid "You can use this command to find out which ports are ephemeral ports:"
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອເບິ່ງວ່າພອດໃດແດ່ທີ່ເປັນພອດຊົ່ວຄາວ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:74
#, no-wrap
msgid "cat /proc/sys/net/ipv4/ip_local_port_range\n"
msgstr "cat /proc/sys/net/ipv4/ip_local_port_range\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "External Inbound Proxy Ports"
msgstr "ພອດຂາເຂົ້າພາຍນອກຂອງ Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:76
msgid "External inbound ports must be opened to configure a firewall on the {productname} Proxy to protect the proxy from unauthorized access."
msgstr "ຕ້ອງເປີດພອດຂາເຂົ້າພາຍນອກເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າໄຟວໍໃນ {productname} Proxy ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນ proxy ຈາກການເຂົ້າເຖິງທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:77
msgid "Opening these ports allows external network traffic to access the {productname} proxy."
msgstr "ການເປີດພອດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການຈະລາຈອນເຄືອຂ່າຍພາຍນອກສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງ {productname} proxy ໄດ້."

#. type: Block title
