#| "| 4506        | TCP      | salt    | Required to accept communication requests from clients.\n"
#| "The client initiates the connection, and it stays open to report results back to the Salt master.\n"
#| "| 8022        |          |         | Required for ssh-push and ssh-push-tunnel contact methods. Clients connected to the proxy initiate check in on the server and hop through to clients.\n"
msgid ""
"| Port number | Protocol | Used By | Notes\n"
"| 22          |          |         | Only required if the user wants to manage the proxy host with {salt} SSH.\n"
"| 67          | TCP/UDP  | DHCP    | Required only if clients are requesting IP addresses from the server.\n"
"| 69          | TCP/UDP  | TFTP    | Required if the server is used as a PXE server for automated client installation.\n"
"| 443         | TCP      | HTTPS   | {webui}, client, and server and proxy (`tftpsync`) requests.\n"
"| 4505        | TCP      | salt    | Required to accept communication requests from clients.\n"
"The client initiates the connection, and it stays open to receive commands from the Salt master.\n"
"| 4506        | TCP      | salt    | Required to accept communication requests from clients.\n"
"The client initiates the connection, and it stays open to report results back to the Salt master.\n"
"| 8022        |          |         | Required for ssh-push and ssh-push-tunnel contact methods. Clients connected to the proxy initiate check in on the server and hop through to clients.\n"
msgstr ""
"| ເລກພອດ | ໂປຣໂຕຄໍ | ໃຊ້ໂດຍ | ໝາຍເຫດ\n"
"| 22 | | | ຈຳເປັນສະເພາະຫາກຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕ້ອງການຈັດການພຣັອກຊີໂຮສ໌ດ້ວຍ {salt} SSH.\n"
"| 67 | TCP/UDP | DHCP | ຈຳເປັນສະເພາະຫາກຄລາຍເອນຕ້ອງການຂໍທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຈາກເຊີເວີ.\n"
"| 69 | TCP/UDP | TFTP | ຈຳເປັນຫາກໃຊ້ເຊີເວີເປັນ PXE server ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງຄລາຍເອນແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ.\n"
"| 443 | TCP | HTTPS | ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ {webui}, ຄລາຍເອນ, ເຊີເວີ ແລະ ພຣັອກຊີ (``tftpsync``).\n"
"| 4505 | TCP | salt | ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອຮັບການສື່ສານຈາກຄລາຍເອນ.\n"
"ຄລາຍເອນຈະເລີ່ມການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ແລະ ເປີດຄ້າງໄວ້ເພື່ອຮັບຄຳສັ່ງຈາກ Salt master.\n"
"| 4506 | TCP | salt | ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອຮັບການສື່ສານຈາກຄລາຍເອນ.\n"
"ຄລາຍເອນຈະເລີ່ມການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ແລະ ເປີດຄ້າງໄວ້ເພື່ອລາຍງານຜົນກັບໄປຫາ Salt master.\n"
"| 8022 | | | ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ແບບ ssh-push ແລະ ssh-push-tunnel.\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:80
#, no-wrap
msgid "External Outbound Proxy Ports"
msgstr "ພອດຂາອອກພາຍນອກຂອງ Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:81
msgid "External outbound ports must be opened to configure a firewall on the {productname} Proxy to restrict what the proxy can access."
msgstr "ຕ້ອງເປີດພອດຂາອອກພາຍນອກເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າໄຟວໍໃນ {productname} Proxy ເພື່ອຈຳກັດສິ່ງທີ່ proxy ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:82
msgid "Opening these ports allows network traffic from the {productname} Proxy to communicate with external services."
msgstr "ການເປີດພອດເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການຈະລາຈອນເຄືອຂ່າຍຈາກ {productname} Proxy ສາມາດສື່ສານກັບບໍລິການພາຍນອກໄດ້."

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:84
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Port number | Protocol | Used By | Notes\n"
"| 80          |          |         | Used to reach the server.\n"
"| 443         | TCP      | HTTPS   | Required for {scclongform}.\n"
"| 4505        | TCP      | Salt    | Required to connect to Salt master either directly or via proxy.\n"
"| 4506        | TCP      | Salt    | Required to connect to Salt master either directly or via proxy.\n"
msgstr ""
"| ເລກພອດ | ໂປຣໂຕຄໍ | ໃຊ້ໂດຍ | ໝາຍເຫດ\n"
"| 80 | | | ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕິດຕໍ່ກັບເຊີເວີ.\n"
"| 443 | TCP | HTTPS | ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ {scclongform}.\n"
"| 4505 | TCP | Salt | ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາ Salt master ທັງແບບໂດຍກົງ ຫຼື ຜ່ານພຣັອກຊີ.\n"
"| 4506 | TCP | Salt | ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາ Salt master ທັງແບບໂດຍກົງ ຫຼື ຜ່ານພຣັອກຊີ.\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:85
#, no-wrap
msgid "External Client Ports"
msgstr "ພອດພາຍນອກຂອງໄຄເອັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:86
msgid "External client ports must be opened to configure a firewall between the {productname} Server and its clients."
msgstr "ຕ້ອງເປີດພອດພາຍນອກຂອງໄຄເອັນເພື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າໄຟວໍລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີ {productname} ແລະ ໄຄເອັນ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:88
#, no-wrap
msgid "External Port Requirements for {productname} Clients"
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການພອດພາຍນອກສຳລັບໄຄເອັນ {productname}"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:89
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Port number | Direction | Protocol | Notes\n"
"| 22          | Inbound   | SSH      | Required for ssh-push and ssh-push-tunnel contact methods.\n"
"| 80          | Outbound  |          | Used to reach the server or proxy.\n"
"| 443         | Outbound  |          | Used to reach the server or proxy.\n"
"| 4505        | Outbound  | TCP      | Required to connect to Salt master either directly or via proxy.\n"
"| 4506        | Outbound  | TCP      | Required to connect to Salt master either directly or via proxy.\n"
"| 9090        | Outbound  | TCP      | Required for Prometheus user interface.\n"
"| 9093        | Outbound  | TCP      | Required for Prometheus alert manager.\n"
"| 9100        | Outbound  | TCP      | Required for Prometheus node exporter.\n"
"| 9117        | Outbound  | TCP      | Required for Prometheus Apache exporter.\n"
"| 9187        | Outbound  | TCP      | Required for Prometheus PostgreSQL.\n"
msgstr ""
"| ເລກພອດ | ທິດທາງ | ໂປຣໂຕຄໍ | ໝາຍເຫດ\n"
"| 22 | ຂາເຂົ້າ | SSH | ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບວິທີການຕິດຕໍ່ແບບ ssh-push ແລະ ssh-push-tunnel.\n"
"| 80 | ຂາອອກ | | ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕິດຕໍ່ກັບເຊີເວີ ຫຼື ພຣັອກຊີ.\n"
"| 443 | ຂາອອກ | | ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຕິດຕໍ່ກັບເຊີເວີ ຫຼື ພຣັອກຊີ.\n"
"| 4505 | ຂາອອກ | TCP | ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາ Salt master ທັງແບບໂດຍກົງ ຫຼື ຜ່ານພຣັອກຊີ.\n"
"| 4506 | ຂາອອກ | TCP | ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາ Salt master ທັງແບບໂດຍກົງ ຫຼື ຜ່ານພຣັອກຊີ.\n"
"| 9090 | ຂາອອກ | TCP | ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ Prometheus user interface.\n"
"| 9093 | ຂາອອກ | TCP | ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ Prometheus alert manager.\n"
"| 9100 | ຂາອອກ | TCP | ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ Prometheus node exporter.\n"
"| 9117 | ຂາອອກ | TCP | ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ Prometheus Apache exporter.\n"
"| 9187 | ຂາອອກ | TCP | ຈຳເປັນສຳລັບ Prometheus PostgreSQL.\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:90
#, no-wrap
