#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:106
msgid "If you are using non-{suse} clients you might also need to allow access to other servers that provide specific packages for those operating systems.  For example, if you have {ubuntu} clients, you will need to be able to access the {ubuntu} server."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານໃຊ້ໄຄເອັນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ {suse}, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງເຊີເວີອື່ນໆທີ່ໃຫ້ບໍລິການແພັກເກັດ ສຳລັບລະບົບປະຕິບັດການນັ້ນໆ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຫາກທ່ານມີໄຄເອັນ {ubuntu}, ທ່ານຕ້ອງສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງເຊີເວີ {ubuntu} ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/network-requirements.adoc:107
msgid "For more information about troubleshooting firewall access for non-{suse} clients, see xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາການເຂົ້າເຖິງໄຟວໍສຳລັບໄຄເອັນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ {suse}, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-firewalls.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Public Cloud Requirements"
msgstr "ຄວາມຕ້ອງການສຳລັບ Public Cloud"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:2
msgid "This section provides the requirements for installing {productname} on public cloud infrastructure.  We have tested these instructions on Amazon EC2, Google Compute Engine, and Microsoft Azure, but they should work on other providers as well, with some variation."
msgstr "ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງ {productname} ໃນໂຄງລ່າງພື້ນຖານ public cloud. ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ທົດສອບຄຳແນະນຳເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໃນ Amazon EC2, Google Compute Engine, ແລະ Microsoft Azure ແລ້ວ, ແຕ່ພວກມັນກໍ່ຄວນຈະໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ກັບຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການອື່ນໆ ເຊັ່ນກັນ ໂດຍອາດມີຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງກັນບາງຢ່າງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:3
msgid "Before you begin, here are some considerations:"
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະເລີ່ມ, ນີ້ແມ່ນບາງສິ່ງທີ່ຄວນພິຈາລະນາ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:4
msgid "The {productname} setup procedure performs a forward-confirmed reverse DNS lookup.  This must succeed in order for the setup procedure to complete and for {productname} to operate as expected.  It is important to perform hostname and IP configuration before you set up {productname}."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname} ຈະມີການເຮັດ forward-confirmed reverse DNS lookup. ສິ່ງນີ້ຕ້ອງສຳເລັດເພື່ອໃຫ້ຂັ້ນຕອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າສຳເລັດສົມບູນ ແລະ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ {productname} ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ຕາມທີ່ຄາດໄວ້. ມັນເປັນສິ່ງສຳຄັນທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າ hostname ແລະ IP ກ່ອນທີ່ທ່ານຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າ {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:5
msgid "{productname} Server and Proxy instances need to run in a network configuration that provides you control over DNS entries, but cannot be accessed from the internet at large."
msgstr "ອິນສະແຕນຊ໌ (Instances) ຂອງ {productname} Server ແລະ Proxy ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງລັນຢູ່ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດຄວບຄຸມ DNS entries ໄດ້, ແຕ່ບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຈາກອິນເຕີເນັດທົ່ວໄປ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:6
msgid "Within this network configuration DNS resolution must be provided: `hostname -f` must return the fully qualified domain name (FQDN)."
msgstr "ພາຍໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄືອຂ່າຍນີ້ ຕ້ອງມີການແກ້ໄຂຊື່ DNS (DNS resolution): `hostname -f` ຕ້ອງສົ່ງຄືນຄ່າເປັນ fully qualified domain name (FQDN)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:7
msgid "DNS resolution is also important for connecting clients."
msgstr "DNS resolution ຍັງມີຄວາມສຳຄັນສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ clients."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:8
msgid "DNS is dependent on the cloud framework you choose.  Refer to the cloud provider documentation for detailed instructions."
msgstr "DNS ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບ cloud framework ທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກ. ໃຫ້ເບິ່ງຄູ່ມືຂອງຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ cloud ສຳລັບຄຳແນະນຳລະອຽດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:9
msgid "We recommend that you locate software repositories, the server database, and the proxy squid cache on an external virtual disk.  This prevents data loss if the instance is unexpectedly terminated.  This section includes instructions for setting up an external virtual disk."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານວາງ software repositories, server database, ແລະ proxy squid cache ໄວ້ໃນດິສກ໌ສະເໝືອນພາຍນອກ (external virtual disk). ນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍປ້ອງກັນຂໍ້ມູນສູນຫາຍຫາກ instance ຢຸດເຮັດວຽກໂດຍບໍ່ຄາດຄິດ. ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ລວມມີຄຳແນະນຳສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ external virtual disk."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:11
msgid "When you use {productname} on a public cloud, you must use a restricted network.  We recommend using a VPC private subnet with an appropriate firewall setting.  Only machines in your specified IP ranges must be able to access the instance."
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານໃຊ້ {productname} ໃນ public cloud, ທ່ານຕ້ອງໃຊ້ເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ຖືກຈຳກັດ. ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ VPC private subnet ພ້ອມກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄຟວໍທີ່ເໝາະສົມ. ເພາະສະເພາະເຄື່ອງທີ່ຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງ IP ທີ່ທ່ານກຳນົດເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຄວນຈະເຂົ້າເຖິງ instance ໄດ້."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:12
msgid "Running {productname} on the public cloud means implementing robust security measures. It is essential to limit, filter, monitor, and audit access to the instance.  {SUSE} strongly advises against a globally accessible {productname} instance that lacks adequate perimeter security."
msgstr "ການລັນ {productname} ໃນ public cloud ໝາຍເຖິງການນຳໃຊ້ມາດຕະການຄວາມປອດໄພທີ່ເຂັ້ມງວດ. ມັນເປັນສິ່ງຈຳເປັນທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງຈຳກັດ, ກັ່ນຕອງ, ຕິດຕາມ, ແລະ ກວດສອບການເຂົ້າເຖິງ instance. {SUSE} ແນະນຳຢ່າງເດັດຂາດບໍ່ໃຫ້ເປີດ instance {productname} ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຈາກທົ່ວໂລກໂດຍຂາດການຮັກສາຄວາມປອດໄພທີ່ພຽງພໍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:13
msgid "To access the {productname} {webui}, allow HTTPS when configuring the network access controls.  This allows you to access the {productname} {webui}."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງ {productname} {webui}, ໃຫ້ອະນຸຍາດ HTTPS ເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າການຄວບຄຸມການເຂົ້າເຖິງເຄືອຂ່າຍ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເຂົ້າເຖິງ {productname} {webui} ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:14
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "In EC2 and Azure, create a new security group, and add inbound and outbound rules for HTTPS.  In GCE, check the ``Allow HTTPS traffic`` box under the ``Firewall`` section."
msgid "In EC2 and Azure, create a new security group, and add inbound and outbound rules for HTTPS.  In GCE, check the `Allow HTTPS traffic` box under the `Firewall` section."
msgstr "ໃນ EC2 ແລະ Azure, ໃຫ້ສ້າງ security group ໃໝ່, ແລະ ເພີ່ມກົດ inbound ແລະ outbound ສຳລັບ HTTPS. ໃນ GCE, ໃຫ້ໝາຍຕິກທີ່ຊ່ອງ ``Allow HTTPS traffic`` ພາຍໃຕ້ພາກສ່ວນ ``Firewall``."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare Storage Volumes"
msgstr "ກຽມບໍລິມາດບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ (Storage Volumes)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:16
msgid "We recommend that the repositories and the database for {productname} are stored on separate storage devices from the root volume.  This will help to avoid data loss and possibly increase performance."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາແນະນຳໃຫ້ເກັບຄັງຊອບແວ ແລະ ຖານຂໍ້ມູນສຳລັບ {productname} ໄວ້ໃນອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກຈາກ root volume. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍຫຼີກເວັ້ນການສູນເສຍຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ອາດຈະຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບການເຮັດວຽກນຳອີກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:17
msgid "The {productname} container utilizes default storage locations. These locations should be configured prior to deployment for custom storage.  For more information see xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc[Persistent container volumes]"
msgstr "ຄອນເທນເນີຂອງ {productname} ໃຊ້ສະຖານທີ່ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ສະຖານທີ່ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຄວນຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າກ່ອນການນຳໃຊ້ ຫາກຕ້ອງການປັບແຕ່ງບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນເອງ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc[Persistent container volumes]"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:18
msgid "Do not use logical volume management (LVM) for public cloud installations."
msgstr "ຢ່າໃຊ້ການຈັດການບໍລິມາດແບບລໍຈິກ (LVM) ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງໃນຄລາວສາທາລະນະ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:19
msgid "The size of the disk for repositories storage is dependent on the number of distributions and channels you intend to manage with {productname}.  When you attach the virtual disks, they will appear in your instance as Unix device nodes.  The names of the device nodes will vary depending on your provider, and the instance type selected."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງດິສກ໌ສຳລັບເກັບ repositories ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບຈຳນວນ distributions ແລະ channels ທີ່ທ່ານຕັ້ງໃຈຈະຈັດການດ້ວຍ {productname}. ເມື່ອທ່ານເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ virtual disks, ພວກມັນຈະປາກົດຢູ່ໃນ instance ຂອງທ່ານເປັນ Unix device nodes. ຊື່ຂອງ device nodes ຈະແຕກຕ່າງກັນໄປຕາມຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການ ແລະ ປະເພດ instance ທີ່ເລືອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:20
msgid "Ensure the root volume of the {productname} Server is 100{nbsp}GB or larger.  Add an additional storage disk of 500{nbsp}GB or more, and choose SSD storage if you can.  The cloud images for {productname} Server use a script to assign this separate volume when your instance is launched."
msgstr "ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ root volume ຂອງ {productname} Server ມີຂະໜາດ 100{nbsp}GB ຫຼື ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ. ເພີ່ມດິສກ໌ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມຂະໜາດ 500{nbsp}GB ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່າ, ແລະ ເລືອກບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນແບບ SSD ຫາກເຮັດໄດ້. Cloud images ສຳລັບ {productname} Server ຈະໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບເພື່ອມອບໝາຍ volume ທີ່ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກນີ້ເມື່ອ instance ຂອງທ່ານຖືກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:21
msgid "When you launch your instance, you can log in to the {productname} Server and use this command to find all available storage devices:"
msgstr "ເມື່ອທ່ານເລີ່ມ instance, ທ່ານສາມາດລັອກອິນເຂົ້າໃນ {productname} Server ແລະ ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ເພື່ອຊອກຫາອຸປະກອນຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດທີ່ມີຢູ່:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:23
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "If you are not sure which device to choose, use the [command]``lsblk`` command to see the name and size of each device.  Choose the name that matches with the size of the virtual disk you are looking for."
msgid "If you are not sure which device to choose, use the `lsblk` command to see the name and size of each device.  Choose the name that matches with the size of the virtual disk you are looking for."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ແນ່ໃຈວ່າຈະເລືອກອຸປະກອນໃດ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``lsblk`` ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຊື່ ແລະ ຂະໜາດຂອງແຕ່ລະອຸປະກອນ. ເລືອກຊື່ທີ່ກົງກັບຂະໜາດຂອງ virtual disk ທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງຊອກຫາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:24
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "You can set up the external disk with the [command]``mgr-storage-server`` command.  This creates an XFS partition mounted at ``/manager_storage`` and uses it as the location for the database and repositories:"
msgid "You can set up the external disk with the `mgr-storage-server` command.  This creates an XFS partition mounted at `/manager_storage` and uses it as the location for the database and repositories:"
msgstr "ເຈົ້າສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າດິສກ໌ພາຍນອກໄດ້ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``mgr-storage-server``. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະສ້າງພາດທິຊັນ (Partition) ແບບ XFS ທີ່ເມົາທ໌ (Mount) ໄວ້ຢູ່ ``/manager_storage`` ແລະ ໃຊ້ມັນເປັນສະຖານທີ່ສຳລັບຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ຄັງຊອບແວ:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "/usr/bin/mgr-storage-server <devicename>\n"
msgstr "/usr/bin/mgr-storage-server <devicename>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/pubcloud-requirements.adoc:26
msgid "For more information about setting up storage volumes and partitions, including recommended minimum sizes, see xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc[]."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ storage volumes ແລະ partitions, ລວມທັງຂະໜາດຂັ້ນຕ່ຳທີ່ແນະນຳ, ເບິ່ງ xref:installation-and-upgrade:hardware-requirements.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-install-requirements.adoc:2
msgid "The following tables specify the minimum server and proxy requirements."
msgstr "ຕາຕະລາງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ລະບຸຂໍ້ກຳນົດຂັ້ນຕ່ຳຂອງເຊີເວີ ແລະ ພຣັອກຊີ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/pages/uyuni-install-requirements.adoc:3
msgid "Do not use NFS for storage because it does not support SELinux file labeling."
msgstr "ຢ່າໃຊ້ NFS ສຳລັບການເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ ເພາະວ່າມັນບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການຕິດສະຫຼາກໄຟລ໌ (File labeling) ຂອງ SELinux."

