#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:4
msgid "For Podman deployment, the container host for the {productname} Proxy must be registered as a client to the {productname} Server prior to generating this proxy configuration."
msgstr "ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງດ້ວຍ Podman, container host ສຳລັບ {productname} Proxy ຕ້ອງຖືກລົງທະບຽນ ເປັນໄຄເອັນກັບ {productname} Server ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະສ້າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ proxy ນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:5
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "If a proxy FQDN is used to generate a proxy container configuration that is not a registered client (as in the Kubernetes use case), a new system entry will appear in system list.  This new entry will be shown under previously entered Proxy FQDN value and will be of [literal]``Foreign`` system type."
msgid "If a proxy FQDN is used to generate a proxy container configuration that is not a registered client (as in the Kubernetes use case), a new system entry will appear in system list.  This new entry will be shown under previously entered Proxy FQDN value and will be of `Foreign` system type."
msgstr "ຫາກໃຊ້ FQDN ຂອງ proxy ເພື່ອສ້າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ proxy container ທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນໄຄເອັນທີ່ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວ (ເຊັ່ນໃນກໍລະນີຂອງ Kubernetes), ຈະມີລາຍການລະບົບໃໝ່ປາກົດຂຶ້ນໃນລາຍຊື່ລະບົບ. ລາຍການໃໝ່ນີ້ຈະສະແດງຢູ່ພາຍໃຕ້ຄ່າ FQDN ຂອງ Proxy ທີ່ປ້ອນໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ ແລະ ຈະເປັນປະເພດລະບົບ [literal]``Foreign``."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-generate_proxy_config.adoc:6
msgid "Peripheral servers are always using third-party SSL certificates.  If the hub server has generated the certificates for the peripheral server, it needs to generate the certificate of each proxy too."
msgstr "ເຊີເວີສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍ (peripheral servers) ແມ່ນນຳໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL ຈາກພາຍນອກສະເໝີ. ຖ້າ hub server ເປັນຜູ້ສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໃຫ້ກັບ peripheral server, ມັນກໍຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສ້າງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໃຫ້ແຕ່ລະພຣັອກຊີຄືກັນ."

