#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:31
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "OPTIONAL: Registration from the command line"
msgstr "ທາງເລືອກ: ການລົງທະບຽນຈາກບັນທັດຄຳສັ່ງ (Command line)"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:32
msgid "If you added {productname} {productnumber} as an extension during {sl-micro} {microversion} installation then you can skip this procedure.  However, optionally you may skip registration during {sl-micro} {microversion} installation by selecting the btn:[Skip Registration] button.  This section provides steps on registering your products after {sl-micro} {microversion} installation."
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານໄດ້ເພີ່ມ {productname} {productnumber} ເປັນສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍໃນລະຫວ່າງການຕິດຕັ້ງ {sl-micro} {microversion} ທ່ານກໍສາມາດຂ້າມຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ໄປໄດ້. ແຕ່ຖ້າທ່ານເລືອກຂ້າມການລົງທະບຽນໃນຕອນຕິດຕັ້ງໂດຍການຄລິກປຸ່ມ [Skip Registration], ພາກສ່ວນນີ້ຈະໃຫ້ຂັ້ນຕອນໃນການລົງທະບຽນຜະລິດຕະພັນຂອງທ່ານຫຼັງຈາກຕິດຕັ້ງ {sl-micro} {microversion} ແລ້ວ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:33
msgid "The following steps register a {productname} {productnumber} extension with the {x86_64} architecture and thus require a registration code for the {x86_64} architecture.  To register {arm} or {s390x} architectures use the correct registration code."
msgstr "ບາດກ້າວຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ແມ່ນການລົງທະບຽນສ່ວນເສີມ {productname} {productnumber} ດ້ວຍສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ {x86_64} ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈຶ່ງຕ້ອງໃຊ້ລະຫັດລົງທະບຽນສຳລັບສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ {x86_64}. ເພື່ອລົງທະບຽນສະຖາປັດຕະຍະກຳ {arm} ຫຼື {s390x} ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ລະຫັດລົງທະບຽນທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:34
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Registering from the command line"
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນ: ການລົງທະບຽນຜ່ານ command line"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:35
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-sles-host.adoc:34
msgid "List available extensions with the following command:"
msgstr "ສະແດງລາຍຊື່ສ່ວນເສີມທີ່ມີຢູ່ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "transactional-update --quiet register --list-extensions\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:37
msgid "From the list of available extensions, select the one you wish to install:"
msgstr "ຈາກລາຍຊື່ສ່ວນເສີມທີ່ມີຢູ່, ໃຫ້ເລືອກອັນທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:38
msgid "If installing the Server, use your {productname} Server Extension {productnumber} x86_64 registration code with following command:"
msgstr "ຫາກຕິດຕັ້ງ Server, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ລະຫັດລົງທະບຽນ {productname} Server Extension {productnumber} x86_64 ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "transactional-update register -p Multi-Linux-Manager-Server/5.2/x86_64 -r <reg_code>\n"
msgstr "transactional-update register -p Multi-Linux-Manager-Server/5.2/x86_64 -r <reg_code>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:40
msgid "If installing the Proxy, use your {productname} Proxy Extension {productnumber} x86_64 registration code with following command:"
msgstr "ຫາກຕິດຕັ້ງ Proxy, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ລະຫັດລົງທະບຽນ {productname} Proxy Extension {productnumber} x86_64 ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "transactional-update register -p Multi-Linux-Manager-Proxy/5.2/x86_64 -r <reg_code>\n"
msgstr "transactional-update register -p Multi-Linux-Manager-Proxy/5.2/x86_64 -r <reg_code>\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:43
