#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:46
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-proxy-host.adoc:23
msgid "Run **transactional-update**:"
msgstr "ຣັນ **transactional-update**:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:49
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-proxy-host.adoc:26
msgid "{sl-micro} is designed to update itself automatically by default and will reboot after applying updates.  However, this behavior is not desirable for the {productname} environment.  To prevent automatic updates on your server, {productname} disables the transactional-update timer during the bootstrap process."
msgstr "{sl-micro} ຖືກອອກແບບມາໃຫ້ອັບເດດຕົວເອງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແລະ ຈະຣີບູດຫຼັງຈາກອັບເດດແລ້ວ. ແຕ່ພຶດຕິກຳນີ້ແມ່ນບໍ່ເໝາະສົມສຳລັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງ {productname}. ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການອັບເດດອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນເຊີເວີຂອງທ່ານ, {productname} ຈະປິດການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ transactional-update timer ໃນລະຫວ່າງຂັ້ນຕອນການບູດສະແຕຣັບ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:50
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-proxy-host.adoc:27
msgid "If you prefer the {sl-micro} default behavior, enable the timer by running the following command:"
msgstr "ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການພຶດຕິກຳເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ {sl-micro}, ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ງານໄທມ໌ເມີ (timer) ໂດຍການລັນຄຳສັ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-host.adoc:51
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-proxy-host.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl enable --now transactional-update.timer\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-prepare-micro-proxy-host.adoc:14
msgid "Skip the registration. The {sl-micro} {microversion} entitlement is included within the {productname} entitlement."
msgstr "ຂ້າມການລົງທະບຽນ. ສິດການນຳໃຊ້ (entitlement) ຂອງ {sl-micro} {microversion} ແມ່ນໄດ້ລວມຢູ່ໃນ ສິດການນຳໃຊ້ຂອງ {productname} ແລ້ວ."

