#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-ssl-requirements.adoc:1
msgid "SSL certificates are needed at a later stage.  If not using the self-signed generated CA and certificates, ensure you have the following before starting:"
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນໃນຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປ. ຖ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ CA ແລະ ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນແບບ self-signed ທີ່ສ້າງໂດຍລະບົບ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທ່ານມີສິ່ງຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເລີ່ມ:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-ssl-requirements.adoc:2
msgid "A certificate authority (CA) SSL public certificate.  If you are using a CA chain, all intermediate CAs must also be available."
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນສາທາລະນະ (public certificate) ຂອງ SSL ຈາກຕົວແທນອອກໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ (CA). ຖ້າທ່ານໃຊ້ CA chain, ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ CA ລະດັບກາງ (intermediate CAs) ທັງໝົດກໍຕ້ອງມີພ້ອມຄືກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-ssl-requirements.adoc:3
msgid "An SSL database private key."
msgstr "ຄີສ່ວນຕົວ (private key) ຂອງ SSL database."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-ssl-requirements.adoc:4
msgid "An SSL database certificate."
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL database."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-ssl-requirements.adoc:5
msgid "All files must be in PEM format."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ທັງໝົດຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ PEM."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-ssl-requirements.adoc:6
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "The hostname of the SSL server certificate must match the fully qualified hostname of the machine you deploy them on.  You can set the hostnames in the [literal]``X509v3 Subject Alternative Name`` section of the certificate.  You can also list multiple hostnames if your environment requires it.  Supported Key types are [literal]``RSA`` and [literal]``EC`` (Elliptic Curve)."
msgid "The hostname of the SSL server certificate must match the fully qualified hostname of the machine you deploy them on.  You can set the hostnames in the `X509v3 Subject Alternative Name` section of the certificate.  You can also list multiple hostnames if your environment requires it.  Supported Key types are `RSA` and `EC` (Elliptic Curve)."
msgstr "ຊື່ໂຮສ (hostname) ຂອງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL server ຕ້ອງກົງກັບຊື່ໂຮສເຕັມ (fully qualified hostname) ຂອງເຄື່ອງທີ່ທ່ານຕິດຕັ້ງ. ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຊື່ໂຮສໄດ້ໃນສ່ວນ [literal]``X509v3 Subject Alternative Name`` ຂອງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດລະບຸໄດ້ຫຼາຍຊື່ໂຮສຖ້າສະພາບແວດລ້ອມຂອງທ່ານຕ້ອງການ. ປະເພດຄີທີ່ຮອງຮັບແມ່ນ [literal]``RSA`` ແລະ [literal]``EC`` (Elliptic Curve)."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-ssl-requirements.adoc:7
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Database SSL certificate requires [literal]``reportdb`` and [literal]``db`` and the FQDN used to access the report database as [literal]``Subject Alternative Name``."
msgid "In the past, database SSL certificate required `reportdb` and `db` as `Subject Alternative Name`.  This is no longer needed, and only the Server FQDN (used to access the report database) is mandatory as `Subject Alternative Name`."
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL ຂອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນຕ້ອງການ [literal]``reportdb``, [literal]``db`` ແລະ FQDN ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການເຂົ້າເຖິງ report database ເປັນ [literal]``Subject Alternative Name``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-ssl-requirements.adoc:8
msgid "The database container needs only the externally facing fully qualified domain name.  The old certificates with `db` and `reportdb` SANs can be still used."
msgstr ""

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-ssl-requirements.adoc:9
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-third-party-ssl.adoc:6
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "The same certificate can be used for both the main container and the database one, but it needs to have those SANs too."
msgid "The same certificate can be used for both the main container and the database one."
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນດຽວກັນສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ທັງ container ຫຼັກ ແລະ container ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ, ແຕ່ມັນຕ້ອງມີ SANs ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນນຳ."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-ssl-requirements.adoc:10
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-third-party-ssl.adoc:7
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "In order to pass the new certificate to the upgrade command, use the [command]``--ssl-db-ca-root``, [command]``--ssl-db-cert`` and [command]``--ssl-db-key`` parameters."
msgid "In order to pass the new certificates to the upgrade command, use the `--ssl-db-ca-root`, `--ssl-db-cert` and `--ssl-db-key` parameters."
msgstr "ເພື່ອສົ່ງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໃໝ່ໃຫ້ກັບຄຳສັ່ງອັບເກຣດ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີ [command]``--ssl-db-ca-root``, [command]``--ssl-db-cert`` ແລະ [command]``--ssl-db-key``."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/installation-and-upgrade/partials/snippet-ssl-requirements.adoc:11
msgid "In {productname} 5.2, internal communication between the `uyuni-server` and `uyuni-db` Podman containers has been optimized.  Because this traffic is strictly local, TLS is now explicitly disabled in `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`.  Consequently, defining `db` and `reportdb` in the certificate's Subject Alternative Names (SAN) is no longer required or used.  However, perimeter security has become stricter, and remote connections to the PostgreSQL port (`5432`) are now explicitly enforced to be TLS-protected via `/var/lib/pgsql/data/pg_hba.conf`."
msgstr ""

