#~ msgid "The [literal]``proxy-cert`` TLS secret is expected.  It contains the TLS certificate and key for the Ingress rule and needs to have the public FQDN as Subject Alternate Name."
#~ msgstr "ຕ້ອງການ secret TLS [literal]``proxy-cert``. ມັນປະກອບດ້ວຍໃບຮັບຮອງ TLS ແລະ key ສຳລັບກົດ Ingress ແລະ ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີ FQDN ແບບສາທາລະນະເປັນ Subject Alternate Name."

#~ msgid "These secrets can be created using the [command]``kubectl create secret tls -n $NAMESPACE`` command.  The certificate file passed to this command needs to start with the server certificate followed by the chain of intermediary CA certificates if any.  The root CA is not needed in these secrets as it is expected in a ConfigMap."
#~ msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນລັບເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດສ້າງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``kubectl create secret tls -n $NAMESPACE``.  ໄຟລ໌ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ສົ່ງໃຫ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີບເວີ ຕາມດ້ວຍສາຍໂສ້ຂອງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ CA ລະດັບກາງ ຖ້າມີ.  root CA ແມ່ນບໍ່ຈຳເປັນໃນຂໍ້ມູນລັບເຫຼົ່ານີ້ ເນື່ອງຈາກມັນຖືກຄາດວ່າຈະມີຢູ່ໃນ ConfigMap."

#~ msgid "The Root CA certificate of [literal]``proxy-cert`` is expected in a ConfigMap named [literal]``uyuni-ca`` stored in the [literal]``ca.crt`` key.  It can be created with a command like [command]``kubectl create cm -n $NAMESPACE uyuni-ca --from-file=ca.crt=/path/to/uyuni-ca.crt``."
#~ msgstr "ໃບຮັບຮອງ Root CA ຂອງ [literal]``proxy-cert`` ຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນ ConfigMap ທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ [literal]``uyuni-ca`` ເຊິ່ງເກັບໄວ້ໃນ key [literal]``ca.crt``. ສາມາດສ້າງໄດ້ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ ເຊັ່ນ [command]``kubectl create cm -n $NAMESPACE uyuni-ca --from-file=ca.crt=/path/to/uyuni-ca.crt``."

