#~ msgid "A secret with the SCC credentials needs to be defined in order to pull the images from `registry.suse.com`.  Refer to https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/configure-pod-container/pull-image-private-registry/ for the instructions to prepare the secret.  Set the `registrySecret` [literal]``server-helm`` chart value to the name of the secret containing those credentials to use it."
#~ msgstr "ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີຂໍ້ມູນລັບ (secret) ຂອງ SCC credentials ເພື່ອດຶງຮູບພາບ (images) ຈາກ `registry.suse.com`. ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດທີ່ https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/configure-pod-container/pull-image-private-registry/ ສຳລັບຂັ້ນຕອນການກຽມ secret. ໃຫ້ກຳນົດຄ່າ `registrySecret` ໃນ [literal]``server-helm`` chart ໃຫ້ເປັນຊື່ຂອງ secret ທີ່ບັນຈຸຂໍ້ມູນປະຈຳຕົວເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນເພື່ອເລີ່ມນຳໃຊ້."

#~ msgid "The following TLS secrets are expected:"
#~ msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນລັບ TLS ທີ່ຕ້ອງການມີດັ່ງນີ້:"

#~ msgid "[literal]``db-cert``: TLS certificate for the report database and needs to have the [literal]``db`` and [literal]``reportdb`` Subject Alternate Names, and the FQDN exposed to the outside world."
#~ msgstr "[literal]``db-cert``: ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ TLS ສຳລັບ report database ເຊິ່ງຕ້ອງມີ [literal]``db`` ແລະ [literal]``reportdb`` ໃນ Subject Alternate Names, ແລະ FQDN ທີ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຈາກພາຍນອກ."

#~ msgid "[literal]``uyuni-cert``: TLS certificate for the Ingress rule and needs to have the public FQDN as Subject Alternate Name."
#~ msgstr "[literal]``uyuni-cert``: ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ TLS ສຳລັບກົດ Ingress ເຊິ່ງຕ້ອງມີ public FQDN ເປັນ Subject Alternate Name."

#~ msgid "These secrets can be created using the [command]``kubectl create secret tls -n $NAMESPACE`` command.  The certificate file passed to this command needs to start with the server certificate followed by the chain of intermediary CA certificates if any.  The root CAs are not needed in these secrets as they are expected in ConfigMaps."
#~ msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນລັບເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສາມາດສ້າງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``kubectl create secret tls -n $NAMESPACE``.  ໄຟລ໌ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ສົ່ງໃຫ້ຄຳສັ່ງນີ້ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນດ້ວຍໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີບເວີ ຕາມດ້ວຍສາຍໂສ້ຂອງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ CA ລະດັບກາງ ຖ້າມີ.  root CA ຕ່າງໆ ແມ່ນບໍ່ຈຳເປັນໃນຂໍ້ມູນລັບເຫຼົ່ານີ້ ເນື່ອງຈາກພວກມັນຖືກຄາດວ່າຈະມີຢູ່ໃນ ConfigMaps."

#~ msgid "The Root CA certificate of [literal]``db-cert`` and [literal]``uyuni-cert`` are expected in ConfigMaps named [literal]``db-ca`` and [literal]``uyuni-ca`` stored in the [literal]``ca.crt`` key.  Those can be created with a command like [command]``kubectl create cm -n $NAMESPACE db-ca --from-file=ca.crt=/path/to/db-ca.crt``."
#~ msgstr "Root CA certificate ຂອງ [literal]``db-cert`` ແລະ [literal]``uyuni-cert`` ແມ່ນຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນ ConfigMaps ທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ [literal]``db-ca`` ແລະ [literal]``uyuni-ca`` ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄີ [literal]``ca.crt``. ສາມາດສ້າງໄດ້ດ້ວຍຄຳສັ່ງ [command]``kubectl create cm -n $NAMESPACE db-ca --from-file=ca.crt=/path/to/db-ca.crt``."

#~ msgid "The server chart defines volumes as Persistent Volume Claims (PVCs)."
#~ msgstr "ເຊີບເວີຊາດ (server chart) ກຳນົດວໍລຸມເປັນ Persistent Volume Claims (PVCs)."

#~ msgid "The creation of the underlying PVs is the responsibility of the cluster administrators."
#~ msgstr "ການສ້າງ PV ທີ່ຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫຼັງແມ່ນຄວາມຮັບຜິດຊອບຂອງຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບຄລັສເຕີ (cluster administrators)."

#~ msgid "The PVCs use the [literal]``ReadWriteOnce`` access mode."
#~ msgstr "PVCs ນຳໃຊ້ໂໝດການເຂົ້າເຖິງແບບ [literal]``ReadWriteOnce``."

#~ msgid "The created PVCs can be tuned using {helm} chart values.  Each of the PVCs can have the following values:"
#~ msgstr "PVCs ທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຄ່າໃນ {helm} chart. ແຕ່ລະ PVC ສາມາດກຳນົດຄ່າຕ່າງໆໄດ້ດັ່ງນີ້:"

#~ msgid "[literal]``storageClass``: can be used to select the storage class to use for the PVC.  This can be useful to select faster storage for the database or the packages storage."
#~ msgstr "[literal]``storageClass``: ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເລືອກ storage class ໃຫ້ກັບ PVC. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການເລືອກບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຄວາມໄວສູງສຳລັບຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ຫຼື ບ່ອນເກັບແພັກເກດ."

#~ msgid "Refer to the [literal]``server-helm`` README for the list of persistent volume claims which will be created and will need to be bound to persistent volumes."
#~ msgstr "ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດໃນ [literal]``server-helm`` README ສຳລັບລາຍຊື່ຂອງ persistent volume claims ທີ່ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ຕ້ອງໄດ້ມີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (bound) ກັບ persistent volumes."

#~ msgid "{productname} requires some TCP and UDP ports to be routed to its services.  Refer to the [literal]``server-helm`` README for the list of ports to be exposed."
#~ msgstr "{productname} ຕ້ອງການພອດ TCP ແລະ UDP ບາງອັນເພື່ອສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນໄປຍັງບໍລິການຂອງມັນ. ເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດໃນ [literal]``server-helm`` README ສຳລັບລາຍຊື່ພອດທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງເປີດອອກ."

#~ msgid "RKE2 ships with nginx as the default ingress controller.  However, as this is deprecated and soon to be unsupported, the [literal]``server-helm`` chart defaults to use Traefik as ingress controller.  Using the nginx ingress controller might work and will not be documented, use at your own risk."
#~ msgstr "RKE2 ມາພ້ອມກັບ nginx ເປັນຕົວຄວບຄຸມ ingress ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, ເນື່ອງຈາກສິ່ງນີ້ກຳລັງຈະຖືກຍົກເລີກ ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບໃນໄວໆນີ້, [literal]``server-helm`` chart ຈຶ່ງກຳນົດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ Traefik ເປັນ ingress controller ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ການໃຊ້ nginx ingress controller ອາດຈະຍັງໃຊ້ໄດ້ຢູ່ແຕ່ຈະບໍ່ມີຄູ່ມືຮອງຮັບ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ດ້ວຍຄວາມສ່ຽງຂອງທ່ານເອງ."

#~ msgid "The [literal]``server-helm`` chart supports Gateway API version 1.4.  Since this requires experimental CRDs which are not shipped with RKE2 1.35, it is not recommended to be used in production."
#~ msgstr "[literal]``server-helm`` chart ຮອງຮັບ Gateway API ເວີຊັນ 1.4. ເນື່ອງຈາກສິ່ງນີ້ຕ້ອງການ experimental CRDs ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ມາພ້ອມກັບ RKE2 1.35, ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ນຳໃຊ້ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມການເຮັດວຽກຈິງ (production)."

