#~ msgid "Some helm charts using the [literal]``server-helm`` chart can be found in the [literal]``{gitchartsbranch}`` branch of the https://github.com/uyuni-project/uyuni-charts/tree/{gitchartsbranch}[uyuni-charts] git repository.  They show case how the TLS certificates can be generated using [literal]``cert-manager`` and [literal]``trust-manager``.  Those examples may assume to have {kube} cluster administrator permissions."
#~ msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດຊອກຫາບາງ helm charts ທີ່ນຳໃຊ້ [literal]``server-helm`` chart ໄດ້ໃນ branch [literal]``{gitchartsbranch}`` ຂອງຄັງເກັບ git https://github.com/uyuni-project/uyuni-charts/tree/{gitchartsbranch}[uyuni-charts]. ຕົວຢ່າງເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນຈະສະແດງວິທີການສ້າງ TLS certificates ໂດຍໃຊ້ [literal]``cert-manager`` ແລະ [literal]``trust-manager``. ຕົວຢ່າງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອາດຈະຕ້ອງໃຊ້ສິດລະດັບ {kube} cluster administrator."

